\"_blank\">خريطة الموقع</a>&nbsp;للاطلاع على قائمة الأقسام داخل الموقع. إذا كان هذا لا يساعد، حاول مربع البحث في أعلى هذه الصفحة.\"</p>','','','404','','','','','','','','',1,'2015-12-07','07 - December - 2015 01:16:28 PM',1,'07 - December - 2015 01:35:34 PM',18,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(127,0,12,'FAQ','FAQ','FAQ\'s','FAQ\'s','FAQ','FAQ',0,'','','','',0,0,0,'xw56jhr47qgf8dv.jpg',1,'<p>The bank started with a paid up capital of AED 1 billion. The bank is supported by the Government of Ajman which owns 25% and it is also supported by leading financial institutions and private individuals from the UAE. The bank has taken an initial public offering of 55% of its equity to raise capital to fund its aggressive roll-out strategy to support its objective of becoming one of the UAE\'s favourite financial services providers. The IPO for Ajman Bank was more than 85 times oversubscribed. The bank is listed on the Dubai Financial Market since Feb 08.</p>','<p>FAQ</p>','','','faq','','','','','','','','',1,'2015-12-07','07 - December - 2015 09:15:40 PM',1,'07 - December - 2015 09:26:56 PM',19,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(128,0,19,'ATMs/CCDMs23','ماكينة الصراف الآلي','ATMs/CCDMs','ماكينة الصراف الآلي','ATMs/CCDMs','ماكينة الصراف الآلي',0,'','','','',0,0,0,'gh415zn7f0qcpkw.jpg',1,'','','','','atm','','','','','','','','',1,'2015-12-12','12 - December - 2015 04:20:59 PM',1,'21 - June - 2020 02:46:51 PM',20,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(129,0,20,'Branches','الفروع','Branches','الفروع','Branches','الفروع',0,'','','','',0,0,0,'',1,'','','','','branches','','','','','','','','',1,'2015-12-12','12 - December - 2015 07:41:50 PM',NULL,NULL,21,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(131,0,9,'Media Gallery','Media Gallery','Media Gallery','Media Gallery','Media Gallery','Media Gallery',0,'','','','',0,0,0,'',1,'','','','','media-gallery','','','','','','','','',1,'2015-12-13','13 - December - 2015 12:19:28 PM',NULL,NULL,22,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(132,0,1,'Consumer Finance',' تمويل المستهلكين','Consumer Finance',' تمويل المستهلكين','Consumer Finance',' تمويل المستهلكين',99,'','','','',1,1,0,'m9z6hj2gsqv18t4.png',1,'<p><span>Ajman Bank aims to be customers\' one-stop financial shop. With our extensive range of product offerings, we assure you the best of services providing complete financial solutions</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>','<p>يهدف مصرف عجمان إلى أن يصبح بوابة شاملة للتمويل تؤمن لك مجموعتنا الشاملة من المنتجات أفضل عروض الخدمات، وتقدم لك حلولا مالية شاملة. إن عروضنا وخدماتنا المالية المصممة وفق احتياجاتك الخاصة تبقيك في موقع الصدارة.</p>','','','consumer-finance','','','','','','','','',1,'2015-12-14','14 - December - 2015 11:06:05 AM',1,'16 - December - 2015 03:46:09 PM',1,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(133,0,1,'Property Finance','التمويل العقاري','Property Finance','التمويل العقاري','Property Finance','التمويل العقاري',132,'','','','',1,0,0,'ksy4fq581pctd39.jpg',1,'<p>Ajman Bank&rsquo;s Consumer Banking flagship product is their Shariah compliant Home Finance product catering to Resident &amp; Non Resident Individual (Salaried or Self Employed) who are interested in buying residential properties or Investment Real Estate properties.</p>\r\n<p>With Ajman Bank customers can buy their dream property by getting the finance and repaying the amount in installments on monthly basis. These properties can be in form of Apartments, Villas, Townhouses, compound villas, buildings, residential and industrial land, which can be registered in respective emirate&rsquo;s Land&rsquo;s department.</p>\r\n<p>Types of properties being financed</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Ready Properties</li>\r\n<li>Under-Construction Properties</li>\r\n<li>Equity Release</li>\r\n<li>Government Housing Program</li>\r\n<li>Land Finance</li>\r\n<li>MAP</li>\r\n</ul>','<p dir=\"RTL\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">يقدم مصرف عجمان من خلال قسم الخدمات المصرفية للأفراد خدمات التمويل العقاري المتوافق مع الشريعة الإسلامية، وهي إحدى خدمات المصرف الرئيسية وأكثرها تميزاً، فهي متوفرة لجميع عملاء المصرف من مقيمين وغير مقيمين، من أصحاب الرواتب أم أصحاب الأعمال الخاصة، الذين يرغبون في شراء عقارات سكنية أو عقارات استثمارية ولكن ليس لديهم السيولة الكافية لذلك. مصرف عجمان يساعد هؤلاء العملاء لشراء عقارات أحلامهم عن طريق توفير خدمة التمويل العقاري مع إمكانية سداد مبلغ التمويل على صورة دفعات شهرية. هذه الخدمة متوفرة لمجموعة كبيرة من العقارات مثل الشقق والفلل والمنازل والفلل ضمن المجمعات السكنية والمباني والأراضي السكنية والصناعية، الخ، على أن يكون العقار معتمداً بشكل رسمي من قبل حكومة دولة الإمارات العربية المتحدة ومستكملاً لكافة الشروط وفقاً لتقرير التقييم ومسجل في دائرة الأراضي في الإمارة المعنية.</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"RTL\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">العقارات التي يقوم المصرف بتمويلها:</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">عقارات جاهزة</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">عقارات قيد الإنشاء</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">أراضي&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>','','','property-finance','','','','','','','','',1,'2015-12-14','14 - December - 2015 11:22:28 AM',1,'01 - June - 2020 12:55:08 PM',1,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(134,0,1,'Ready Properties','عقارات جاهزة','Ready Properties','عقارات جاهزة','Ready Properties','عقارات جاهزة',133,'','','','',1,0,0,'fps5zmbtg816r7q.jpg',1,'<p>Individual (Salaried or Self Employed) who are interested in buying completed residential properties in the form of Apartments, Villas, Townhouses, compound villas, buildings, etc.</p>\r\n<p>Ajman Bank provides finance for the following 2 types of Ready properties:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1st Rank Mortgage</li>\r\n<li>2nd Rank Mortgage</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Features &amp; Benefits*:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Maximum Finance amount up to AED 15 Million.</li>\r\n<li>Maximum tenure up to 25 years.</li>\r\n<li>Finance to value of up to:</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 60px;\"><strong>1st Rank Mortgage:</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 60px;\">Up to 80% for UAE Nationals, 75% for Resident Expatriates and 50% for Non Residents</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 60px;\"><strong>2nd Rank Mortgage:</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 60px;\">Up to 85% for UAE Nationals</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finance for property having existing Title Deed and which can be registered in Lands Department</li>\r\n<li>Free Like Takaful ( Insurance) for complete term of the finance.</li>\r\n<li>Financing available for Freehold &amp; Non Freehold properties</li>\r\n<li>Financing available for Residents &amp; Non Residents</li>\r\n<li>Widest geographical coverage.</li>\r\n<li>Quick and Fast Approvals.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>*Terms and conditions apply</p>\r\n<p><strong>Property Classification Definition:-</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Freehold Properties</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 60px;\">The properties which are given or sold by the developers/sellers and give buyer (i.e. UAE Nationals and Expatriates) the rights to own are termed as free hold properties. Freehold properties are built on specific locations as approved by the government authorities.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Non - Freehold Properties</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 60px;\">Non free hold properties pertain to areas where UAE Nationals &amp; GCC Nationals can buy properties. The title deeds / mortgage deeds are issued by respective municipality and hence are eligible for finance.</p>\r\n<p>The following are the transactions available under Ready Properties:</p>\r\n<table border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>New Purchase</td>\r\n<td>Means to buy a property directly from the developer</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Resale</td>\r\n<td>Means to buy a property from secondary market</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Buyout</td>\r\n<td><ol style=\"list-style-type: lower-alpha;\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Standalone Buyout: - means customer will transfer his existing finance</p>\r\n<p>from another bank to Ajman Bank.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Buyout &amp; Equity Release: - means customer can transfer his existing</p>\r\n<p>finance from another bank and apart from that can avail extra cash</p>\r\n<p>against the equity in his property.</p>\r\n<p>Resale Buyout: - means a transaction of buying a property in the</p>\r\n<p>secondary market between buyer and seller and Ajman Bank will</p>\r\n<p>buyout the finance of the seller from another bank of FI.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><strong>Eligibility:</strong></p>\r\n<p>The following customers are eligible for availing Ready Property financing from Ajman Bank</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>UAE Nationals (Salary starting from AED 15,000 per month).</li>\r\n<li>Resident Expatriates (Salary starting from AED 20,000 per month).</li>\r\n<li>Non-Residents (Salary starting from AED 40,000 per month).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Documentation for Approval:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Duly completed and signed application form</li>\r\n<li>Valid passport/Khulasat al Khaid Copy/Valid visa/UAE National ID</li>\r\n<li>6 months Bank statement</li>\r\n<li>Salary Certificate</li>\r\n<li>Copy of Trade License (Self-employed)</li>\r\n<li>Audited financial statements (Self-employed)</li>\r\n<li>Relevant property papers (Not required for Pre-approval)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>FAQs</strong></p>\r\n<p>Please click on the below link for frequently asked questions &ndash;<a title=\"AB FAQ\" href=\"../files/FAQ/FAQ_-_Property_Finance.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"> Property Finance FAQ</a></p>\r\n<p><strong>Important Note</strong></p>\r\n<p>Property bought directly from the developer or in Abu Dhabi, needs to be registered as approved developer/project with Ajman Bank.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 60px;\">&nbsp;</p>','<p dir=\"RTL\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">لقد أصبح بإمكان عملاء المصرف من الأفراد، سواء أكانوا من أصحاب الرواتب الشهرية أو الأعمال الخاصة، ممن يرغبون بشراء عقارات سكنية جاهزة للتسليم على صورة شقق أو فلل مستقلة أو منازل أو فلل في مجمع سكني أو مباني، الخ، تحقيق أحلامهم من خلال خدمة مصرف عجمان لتمويل العقارات الجاهزة بشرط أن تكون تلك العقارات معتمدة من قبل حكومة دولة الإمارات العربية المتحدة ومستكملةً لكافة الشروط وفقاً لتقرير التقييم في مناطق التملك الحر وغير الحر.</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"RTL\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">تصنيف العقارات:</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"RTL\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">أ) تملك العقارات</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"RTL\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">وتسمى الخصائص التي تعطى أو تباع من قبل المطورين / البائعين وتعطي المشتري (أي المواطنين والمقيمين<strong> UAE) </strong>الحق في تملك العقارات كما عقد الحرة. يتم بناؤها تملك العقارات في مواقع محددة كما وافقت عليها السلطات الحكومية<strong>.</strong></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"RTL\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">ب) غير - عقارات التملك الحر</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"RTL\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">غير خصائص عقد المجانية تتعلق المناطق التي مواطني دولة الإمارات ودول مجلس التعاون الخليجي مواطني (مناطق محددة) يمكن شراء العقارات. وتصدر سندات الملكية / سندات الرهن العقاري من قبل البلدية المعنية، وبالتالي مؤهلة للحصول على التمويل<strong>.</strong></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"RTL\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">يوفر مصرف عجمان المالية لنوع 2 التالية من خصائص جاهزة<strong>:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"RTL\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>1) 1 </strong>مرتبة الرهن العقاري</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"RTL\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>2) 2ND </strong>الرتبة الرهن العقاري</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"RTL\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">أ) قرض الإسكان الوطني<strong> (NHL)</strong></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"RTL\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">ب) برنامج الشيخ زايد للإسكان<strong> (SZHP)</strong></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"RTL\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">ج) مؤسسة محمد بن راشد للإسكان (<strong>MRHE</strong>)</span></p>','','','ready-properties','','','','','','','','',1,'2015-12-14','14 - December - 2015 11:23:28 AM',1,'16 - January - 2020 04:40:57 PM',0,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(135,0,1,'Under-Construction Properties','عقارات قيد الإنشاء ','Under-Construction Properties','عقارات قيد الإنشاء ','Under-Construction Properties','عقارات قيد الإنشاء ',133,'','','','',1,0,0,'wxkd27fqg6p9sjr.jpg',1,'<p>Under this product variant, customer approaches the Bank and requests for financing in order to construct a house or villa. The customer would either opt for self-construction or construction through a developer in this case.</p>\r\n<p>Ajman Bank provides under construction finance for the following 2 types of properties:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1st Rank Mortgage</li>\r\n<li>2nd Rank Mortgage</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Features &amp; Benefits</strong><strong>*</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Maximum Finance amount up to AED&nbsp;8 million</li>\r\n<li>Maximum tenure up to 25 years (inclusive of Construction period)</li>\r\n<li>Finance to value of up to 50%</li>\r\n<li>Free Like Takaful (Insurance) for complete term of the finance</li>\r\n<li>Financing available for Freehold &amp; Non Freehold properties</li>\r\n<li>Financing available for Residents only</li>\r\n<li>Widest geographical coverage</li>\r\n<li>Quick and Fast Approvals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>*Terms and conditions apply</p>\r\n<p>The following types of construction finance are offered under Forward Ijarah:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Istisna Purchase</strong>: In this agreement, bank appoints the customer as its contractor to construct the property. The customer is responsible for the construction and progressive payments are released to the customer on submission of completion certificates. Post completion, bank will lease the property to the customer Ijarah payments.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 30px;\">The progressive payments are released to the customer and the evidence of the payment to the contractor needs to be submitted by the customer back to the bank. The customer is not allowed to make any alterations in the approved construction plan prior to the bank&rsquo;s approval.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>SPA</strong>: If customer is buying a property from the developer and the down payment is not yet made, bank will sign the SPA (Sales &amp; Purchase Agreement) directly with the developer. Customer will make a down payment or pay the initial payments to the developer followed by the payments from the bank till property handover.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 30px;\">This SPA needs to be Shariah compliant and approved by Ajman Bank Legal dept/Shariah Dept.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Tripartite Agreement or Assignment Agreement</strong>: If a customer is purchasing an under construction property from the developer and has made the down payment (or any other payment related to property) to the developer, the customer will surrender his rights on the property by way of tripartite agreement. Bank will be the new owner in developer&rsquo;s records and the progressive payments (after required down payment from the customer) will be made directly to the developer till property handover. The Tripartite agreement/assignment agreement needs to be approved by Ajman Bank Legal/Shariah dept.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>The following are the transactions available under Under-Construction financing:</p>\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"168\">\r\n<p><strong>New Purchase</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"471\">\r\n<p>Means finance to construct a property</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"168\">\r\n<p><strong>Standalone Buyout</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"471\">\r\n<p>Means customer will transfer his existing home finance from another bank/FI to Ajman Bank</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"168\">\r\n<p><strong>Seller Buyout</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"471\">\r\n<p>Means a transaction of buying a property in the secondary market between buyer and seller and Ajman Bank will buyout the finance of the seller from another bank or FI.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><strong>Approved List of Developers/Projects:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Emaar Properties (Limited Projects)</li>\r\n<li>Aldar/Sorouh (Limited Projects)</li>\r\n<li>Manazel Real Estate (Limited Projects)</li>\r\n<li>Meydan Sobha</li>\r\n<li>Al Seeb Properties (Al Safeer Towers 1 &amp; 2)</li>\r\n<li>Al Zorah - Golf Villas</li>\r\n<li>Charlestates - Jasmine Residential Complex</li>\r\n<li>Real Estate Investment Public Corporation - Flamingo Villas</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>* New projects for all developers need to be approved by Ajman Bank Management. Terms and conditions apply</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>Eligibility</strong></p>\r\n<p>The following customers are eligible for availing Under construction finance from Ajman Bank</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>UAE Nationals (Salary starting from AED 25,000)</li>\r\n<li>Resident Expatriates (Salary starting from AED 25,000)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Documentation</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Duly completed and signed application form</li>\r\n<li>Valid passport/Khulasat al Khaid Copy/Valid visa/UAE National ID</li>\r\n<li>6 months Bank statement</li>\r\n<li>Salary Certificate</li>\r\n<li>Copy of Trade License (Self-employed)</li>\r\n<li>Audited financial statements (Self-employed)</li>\r\n<li>Relevant property papers&nbsp;(Not required for Pre-approval)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>FAQs</strong><strong>:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Please click on the below link for frequently asked questions &ndash; <a title=\"AB FAQ\" href=\"../files/FAQ/FAQ_-_Property_Finance.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Property Finance FAQ</strong></a></p>','<p>Under this product variant, customer approaches the Bank and requests for financing in order to construct a house or villa. The customer would either opt for self-construction or construction through a developer in this case.</p>\r\n<p>Ajman Bank provides under construction finance for the following 2 types of properties:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1st Rank Mortgage</li>\r\n<li>2nd Rank Mortgage</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Features &amp; Benefits</strong><strong>*</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Maximum Finance amount up to AED&nbsp;8 million</li>\r\n<li>Maximum tenure up to 25 years (inclusive of Construction period)</li>\r\n<li>Finance to value of up to 50%</li>\r\n<li>Free Like Takaful (Insurance) for complete term of the finance</li>\r\n<li>Financing available for Freehold &amp; Non Freehold properties</li>\r\n<li>Financing available for Residents only</li>\r\n<li>Widest geographical coverage</li>\r\n<li>Quick and Fast Approvals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>*Terms and conditions apply</p>\r\n<p>The following types of construction finance are offered under Forward Ijarah:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Istisna Purchase</strong>: In this agreement, bank appoints the customer as its contractor to construct the property. The customer is responsible for the construction and progressive payments are released to the customer on submission of completion certificates. Post completion, bank will lease the property to the customer Ijarah payments.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 30px;\">The progressive payments are released to the customer and the evidence of the payment to the contractor needs to be submitted by the customer back to the bank. The customer is not allowed to make any alterations in the approved construction plan prior to the bank&rsquo;s approval.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>SPA</strong>: If customer is buying a property from the developer and the down payment is not yet made, bank will sign the SPA (Sales &amp; Purchase Agreement) directly with the developer. Customer will make a down payment or pay the initial payments to the developer followed by the payments from the bank till property handover.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 30px;\">This SPA needs to be Shariah compliant and approved by Ajman Bank Legal dept/Shariah Dept.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Tripartite Agreement or Assignment Agreement</strong>: If a customer is purchasing an under construction property from the developer and has made the down payment (or any other payment related to property) to the developer, the customer will surrender his rights on the property by way of tripartite agreement. Bank will be the new owner in developer&rsquo;s records and the progressive payments (after required down payment from the customer) will be made directly to the developer till property handover. The Tripartite agreement/assignment agreement needs to be approved by Ajman Bank Legal/Shariah dept.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>The following are the transactions available under Under-Construction financing:</p>\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"168\">\r\n<p><strong>New Purchase</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"471\">\r\n<p>Means finance to construct a property</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"168\">\r\n<p><strong>Standalone Buyout</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"471\">\r\n<p>Means customer will transfer his existing home finance from another bank/FI to Ajman Bank</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"168\">\r\n<p><strong>Seller Buyout</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"471\">\r\n<p>Means a transaction of buying a property in the secondary market between buyer and seller and Ajman Bank will buyout the finance of the seller from another bank or FI.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><strong>Approved List of Developers/Projects:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Emaar Properties (Limited Projects)</li>\r\n<li>Aldar/Sorouh (Limited Projects)</li>\r\n<li>Manazel Real Estate (Limited Projects)</li>\r\n<li>Meydan Sobha</li>\r\n<li>Al Seeb Properties (Al Safeer Towers 1 &amp; 2)</li>\r\n<li>Al Zorah - Golf Villas</li>\r\n<li>Charlestates - Jasmine Residential Complex</li>\r\n<li>Real Estate Investment Public Corporation - Flamingo Villas</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>* New projects for all developers need to be approved by Ajman Bank Management. Terms and conditions apply</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>Eligibility</strong></p>\r\n<p>The following customers are eligible for availing Under construction finance from Ajman Bank</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>UAE Nationals (Salary starting from AED 25,000)</li>\r\n<li>Resident Expatriates (Salary starting from AED 25,000)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Documentation</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Duly completed and signed application form</li>\r\n<li>Valid passport/Khulasat al Khaid Copy/Valid visa/UAE National ID</li>\r\n<li>6 months Bank statement</li>\r\n<li>Salary Certificate</li>\r\n<li>Copy of Trade License (Self-employed)</li>\r\n<li>Audited financial statements (Self-employed)</li>\r\n<li>Relevant property papers&nbsp;(Not required for Pre-approval)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>FAQs</strong><strong>:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Please click on the below link for frequently asked questions &ndash; <strong>Property Finance FAQ</strong></p>','','','2-under-construction-properties','','','','','','','','',1,'2015-12-14','14 - December - 2015 11:24:08 AM',8,'05 - April - 2016 10:16:13 AM',1,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(136,0,1,'Equity Release','Equity Release','Equity Release','Equity Release','Equity Release','Equity Release',133,'','','','',1,0,0,'hw7pdzjns92xyg0.jpg',1,'<p>Equity Release is a convenient yet effective option for a customer to avail cash against the value tied up in their property. Equity Release gives homeowners the flexibility of making use of their home equity value in order to have access to cash for other requirements.</p>\r\n<p>Ajman Bank provides Equity Release for Completed Properties only (Both 1st and 2nd Rank Properties) and Land (1st Rank Properties)</p>\r\n<p><strong>Features &amp; Benefits*</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Maximum Finance amount up to AED&nbsp;10 million against Property and AED&nbsp;8 million</li>\r\n<li>Maximum tenure up to 25 years</li>\r\n<li>Finance to value of up to:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1st Rank Mortgage:</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 90px;\">Up to 80% for UAE Nationals and 75% for Resident Expatriates<br />Up to 65% for Land.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>2nd Rank Mortgage:</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 90px;\">Up to 85% for UAE Nationals</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Free Like Takaful (Insurance) for complete term of the finance</li>\r\n<li>Financing available for Freehold &amp; Non Freehold properties</li>\r\n<li>Financing available for Residents only</li>\r\n<li>Widest geographical coverage</li>\r\n<li>Quick and Fast Approvals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>*Terms and conditions apply</p>\r\n<p>The following are the transactions available under this:</p>\r\n<table border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Type of Transaction</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>Description / Interpretation</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Equity Release</strong></td>\r\n<td><ol style=\"list-style-type: lower-alpha;\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Standalone Equity Release</strong>:- means customer can avail cash against his</p>\r\n<p>property/land</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Additional Finance ( Top Up)</strong>:- Existing Ajman Bank customer can avail</p>\r\n<p>extra cash against his property/land already mortgaged with Ajman Bank</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><strong>Eligibility</strong></p>\r\n<p>The following customers are eligible for availing Equity Release from Ajman Bank</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>UAE Nationals (Salary starting from AED 15,000)</li>\r\n<li>Resident Expatriates (Salary starting from AED 20,000)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Documentation</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Duly completed and signed application form</li>\r\n<li>Valid passport/Khulasat al Khaid Copy/Valid visa/UAE National ID</li>\r\n<li>6 months Bank statement</li>\r\n<li>Salary Certificate</li>\r\n<li>Copy of Trade License (Self-employed)</li>\r\n<li>Audited financial statements (Self-employed)</li>\r\n<li>Relevant property papers&nbsp;(Not required for Pre-approval)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>FAQs</strong></p>\r\n<p>Please click on the below link for frequently asked questions &ndash; Property Finance FAQ</p>','','','','equity-release','','','','','','','','',1,'2015-12-14','14 - December - 2015 11:25:32 AM',6,'28 - February - 2017 03:38:26 PM',2,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(137,0,1,'Land Finance','أراضي','Land Finance','أراضي','Land Finance','أراضي',133,'','','','',1,0,0,'1mg95n82d0khbqj.jpg',1,'<p>Ajman Bank launched Land Finance in 2014 as a unique and innovative Shariah compliant offering for both UAE Nationals and Expatriates to purchase land for purpose of investment or construction for owner occupation / rental. This product is being catered by limited banks however under the Personal Finance product and thus Ajman Bank has focused on positioning this product on quality and innovation to differentiate its product from the competitors.</p>\r\n<p>Ajman Bank provides Land Finance only for 1st Rank Properties only.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Features &amp; Benefits*</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Maximum Finance amount up to AED 8 million</li>\r\n<li>Maximum tenure up to 20 years</li>\r\n<li>Finance to value of up to:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>UAE Nationals:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>65% Finance to value in case of Residential Land</li>\r\n<li>60% Finance to value in case of Commercial Land</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>UAE Residents - Expats:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>60% Finance to value in case of Residential Land</li>\r\n<li>55% Finance to value in case of Commercial Land</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>Free Like Takaful (Insurance) for complete term of the finance</li>\r\n<li>Financing available for Freehold &amp; Non Freehold properties</li>\r\n<li>Financing available for Residents only</li>\r\n<li>Widest geographical coverage</li>\r\n<li>Quick and Fast Approvals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>*Terms and conditions apply</p>\r\n<p>The following are the transactions available under this:</p>\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"168\">\r\n<p>Type of Transaction</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"471\">\r\n<p>Description / Interpretation</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"168\">\r\n<p>New Purchase</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"471\">\r\n<p>Means to buy a land directly from the seller/ developer</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"168\">\r\n<p>Resale</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"471\">\r\n<p>means a transaction of buying a land in the secondary market between buyers and seller</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"168\">\r\n<p>Buyout</p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"471\">\r\n<p>a)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Standalone Buyout: - means customer will transfer his existing finance from another bank to Ajman Bank.</p>\r\n<p>b)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Buyout &amp; Equity Release: - &nbsp;means customer can transfer his existing finance from another bank and apart from that can avail extra cash against the equity in his land.</p>\r\n<p>c)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Resale Buyout: - means a transaction of buying a land in the secondary market between buyer and seller and Ajman Bank will buyout the finance of the seller from another bank of FI.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><strong>Eligibility</strong></p>\r\n<p>The following customers are eligible for availing Land Finance from Ajman Bank</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>UAE Nationals (Salary starting from AED 30,000)</li>\r\n<li>Resident Expatriates (Salary starting from AED 40,000)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Documentation</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Duly completed and signed application form</li>\r\n<li>Valid passport/Khulasat al Khaid Copy/Valid visa/UAE National ID</li>\r\n<li>6 months Bank statement</li>\r\n<li>Salary Certificate</li>\r\n<li>Copy of Trade License (Self-employed)</li>\r\n<li>Audited financial statements (Self-employed)</li>\r\n<li>Relevant property papers&nbsp;(Not required for Pre-approval)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>FAQs</strong></p>\r\n<p>Please click on the below link for frequently asked questions &ndash; <a title=\"AB-FAQ\" href=\"../files/FAQ/FAQ_-_Property_Finance.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Property Finance FAQ</strong></a></p>','<p>Ajman Bank launched Land Finance in 2014 as a unique and innovative Shariah compliant offering for both UAE Nationals and Expatriates to purchase land for purpose of investment or construction for owner occupation / rental. This product is being catered by limited banks however under the Personal Finance product and thus Ajman Bank has focused on positioning this product on quality and innovation to differentiate its product from the competitors.</p>\r\n<p>Ajman Bank provides Land Finance only for 1st Rank Properties only.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Features &amp; Benefits*</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Maximum Finance amount up to AED 8 million</li>\r\n<li>Maximum tenure up to 20 years</li>\r\n<li>Finance to value of up to:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>UAE Nationals:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>65% Finance to value in case of Residential Land</li>\r\n<li>60% Finance to value in case of Commercial Land</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>UAE Residents - Expats:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>60% Finance to value in case of Residential Land</li>\r\n<li>55% Finance to value in case of Commercial Land</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>Free Like Takaful (Insurance) for complete term of the finance</li>\r\n<li>Financing available for Freehold &amp; Non Freehold properties</li>\r\n<li>Financing available for Residents only</li>\r\n<li>Widest geographical coverage</li>\r\n<li>Quick and Fast Approvals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>*Terms and conditions apply</p>\r\n<p>The following are the transactions available under this:</p>\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"168\">\r\n<p><strong>Type of Transaction</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"471\">\r\n<p><strong>Description / Interpretation</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"168\">\r\n<p><strong>New Purchase </strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"471\">\r\n<p>Means to buy a land directly from the seller/ developer</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"168\">\r\n<p><strong>Resale</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"471\">\r\n<p>means a transaction of buying a land in the secondary market between buyers and seller</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"168\">\r\n<p><strong>Buyout </strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"471\">\r\n<p>a)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <strong>Standalone Buyout</strong>: - means customer will transfer his existing finance from another bank to Ajman Bank.</p>\r\n<p>b)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <strong>Buyout &amp; Equity Release</strong>: - &nbsp;means customer can transfer his existing finance from another bank and apart from that can avail extra cash against the equity in his land.</p>\r\n<p>c)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <strong>Resale Buyout</strong>: - means a transaction of buying a land in the secondary market between buyer and seller and Ajman Bank will buyout the finance of the seller from another bank of FI.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><strong>Eligibility</strong></p>\r\n<p>The following customers are eligible for availing Land Finance from Ajman Bank</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>UAE Nationals (Salary starting from AED 30,000)</li>\r\n<li>Resident Expatriates (Salary starting from AED 40,000)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Documentation</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Duly completed and signed application form</li>\r\n<li>Valid passport/Khulasat al Khaid Copy/Valid visa/UAE National ID</li>\r\n<li>6 months Bank statement</li>\r\n<li>Salary Certificate</li>\r\n<li>Copy of Trade License (Self-employed)</li>\r\n<li>Audited financial statements (Self-employed)</li>\r\n<li>Relevant property papers&nbsp;(Not required for Pre-approval)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>FAQs</strong></p>\r\n<p>Please click on the below link for frequently asked questions &ndash; <strong>Property Finance FAQ</strong></p>','','','land-finance','','','','','','','','',1,'2015-12-14','14 - December - 2015 11:26:09 AM',1,'16 - January - 2020 04:44:46 PM',4,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(138,0,1,'Govt. Housing Program','Govt. Housing Program','Govt. Housing Program','','Govt. Housing Program','Govt. Housing Program',133,'','','','',1,0,0,'s9xz45mbht13j2v.jpg',1,'<p>The federal and local governments in UAE are providing housing assistance to UAE nationals through prominenthousing programs which are (but not limited to):-</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>National Housing Loan (NHL).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Sheikh Zayed Housing Program (SZHP).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>Mohamed Bin Rashid Housing Establishment (MRHE).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Features &amp; Benefits*</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Maximum Finance amount up to AED&nbsp;12 million for NHL and 5 million for SHZP &amp; MRHE.</li>\r\n<li>Maximum tenure up to 25 years.</li>\r\n<li>Finance to value of up to 85%.</li>\r\n<li>Free Like Takaful (Insurance) for complete term of the finance.</li>\r\n<li>Financing available for Freehold &amp; Non Freehold properties.</li>\r\n<li>Financing available for UAE Nationals only.</li>\r\n<li>Widest geographical coverage.,</li>\r\n<li>Quick and Fast Approvals.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>*Terms and conditions apply</p>\r\n<p>The following are the transactions available under this:</p>\r\n<table border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Type of Transaction</td>\r\n<td>Description / Interpretation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>New Finance</td>\r\n<td>Means customer already has approval / finance from housing program and he is requesting to complete his construcion Or to buy a ready property</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Buyout</td>\r\n<td><ol style=\"list-style-type: lower-alpha;\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Standalone Buyout: - Means customer will transfer his existing 2nd Degree home finance from another bank to Ajman Bank.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Buyout &amp; Equity Release: - Means customer will transfer his existing 2nd Degree home finance from another bank to Ajman Bank and he is requesting for cash or to settle his liabilities with Ajman Bank or other banks (other than home finance).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><strong>Eligibility</strong></p>\r\n<p>The following customers are eligible for availing Govt Housing Program from Ajman Bank</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>UAE Nationals (Salary starting from AED 15,000)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Documentation</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Duly completed and signed application form.</li>\r\n<li>Valid passport/Khulasat al Khaid Copy/UAE National ID.</li>\r\n<li>6 months Bank statement.</li>\r\n<li>Salary Certificate.</li>\r\n<li>Relevant property papers (Not required for Pre-approval).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>FAQs</strong></p>\r\n<p>Please click on the below link for frequently asked questions &ndash; <a title=\"AB-FAQ\" href=\"../files/FAQ/FAQ_-_Property_Finance.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Property Finance FAQ</a></p>','','','','govt-housing-program','','','','','','','','',1,'2015-12-14','14 - December - 2015 11:26:48 AM',1,'16 - January - 2020 04:43:17 PM',3,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(139,0,1,'Personal Finance','التمويل الشخصي','Personal Finance','التمويل الشخصي','Personal Finance','التمويل الشخصي',132,'','','','',1,0,0,'v1gc83xwybz9psj.jpg',1,'<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Overview</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>Enjoy the good life with Ajman Bank Personal Finance. With competitive profit rates and a range of most exciting benefits, you can now have it all! Be it a highly coveted product, a luxurious experience or a life changing event&hellip;.the choice is exclusively yours!</p>','<p dir=\"RTL\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">التمويل الشخصي </span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"RTL\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">&nbsp;تمتع بنمط حياة مريح مع خدمة التمويل الشخصي من مصرف عجمان، بمعدلات ربح تنافسية ومجموعة واسعة من المزايا الرائعة التي يمكنك الحصول عليها اليوم من خلال هذه الخدمة! فسواء أكنت تسعى للحصول على سلعة معينة أم كنت ترغب بخوض تجربة استثنائية أو حتى إن كنت تخطط لتغيير أسلوب حياتك فالخيار أصبح بين يدك!</span></p>','','','personal-finance','','','','','','','','',1,'2015-12-14','14 - December - 2015 11:27:28 AM',2,'11 - January - 2016 05:43:43 PM',2,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(140,0,1,'Murabaha','مرابحة السلع التجارية','Murabaha','مرابحة السلع التجارية','Murabaha','مرابحة السلع التجارية',139,'','','','',1,0,0,'xm8wps96htvdnqj.jpg',1,'<p>Ajman Bank Personal Finance allows you access to cash through Commodity Murabaha. This product is based on the Islamic financing structure of Murabaha, a commercial transaction which involves the buy and sale of goods that has been promised to be purchased by an ultimate buyer with an added profit margin. The added profit margin could be mentioned in the form of a fixed lump sum or a percentage of the Price of the Goods.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Standard Personal Finance / Settlement of Debts</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Features</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Up to AED 3,000,000 finance for UAE Nationals</li>\r\n<li>Up to AED 1,000,000 finance for Expatriates</li>\r\n<li>Minimum Salary of AED 6,500 for Expatriates &amp; AED 8,000 for UAE Nationals</li>\r\n<li>Repayment tenor of up to 4 years</li>\r\n<li>Simple documentation</li>\r\n<li>Quick processing</li>\r\n<li>Pre-Approved Credit Card with lifestyle benefits</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Documents</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Application Form</li>\r\n<li>Copy of Passport (with Residence visa for expatriates)</li>\r\n<li>Emirates ID Card Copy</li>\r\n<li>Salary Certificate / Salary Transfer Letter from the employer</li>\r\n<li>3 / 6 months bank statement&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Terms &amp; Conditions apply.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Takeover Finance &ndash; UAE Nationals Only</strong></p>\r\n<p>Ajman Bank Personal Finance offers consolidation of debts for UAE Nationals i.e. takeover all customer liabilities (except home finance) from other banks &amp; financial institutions to enjoy the lower installment and high liquidity. The facility is offered through Commodity Murabaha which is based on the Islamic financing structure of Murabaha,</p>\r\n<p><strong>Features</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Up to AED 4,500,000 finance for UAE Nationals</li>\r\n<li>Minimum Salary of AED 20,000</li>\r\n<li>Repayment tenor of up to 25 years</li>\r\n<li>Simple documentation</li>\r\n<li>Quick processing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Documents</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Application Form</li>\r\n<li>Copy of Passport (with Residence visa for expatriates)</li>\r\n<li>Emirates ID Card Copy</li>\r\n<li>Salary Certificate / Salary Transfer Letter from the employer</li>\r\n<li>6 months bank statement</li>\r\n<li>Liability Letter from existing bank&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Terms &amp; Conditions apply.</p>\r\n<p>Please call 800-22 for more details.</p>','<p dir=\\\"RTL\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">يوفر لك منتج التمويل الشخصي من مصرف عجمان إمكانية الحصول على السيولة النقدية التي تحتاجها من خلال خدمة مرابحة البضائع، القائمة على مبدأ \\\" المرابحة\\\". وتعرف \\\"المرابحة\\\" بأنها صفقة تجارية أو اتفاق على التبايع بثمن يوازي رأس المال الأصلي، أي سعر التكلفة، مضافاً إليه هامش الربح الذي قد يكون على صورة مبلغ محدد يتم اقتطاعه أو كنسبة مئوية من ثمن السلعة.</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\\\"RTL\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir=\\\"RTL\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>التمويل الشخصي / تسوية الديون</strong></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\\\"RTL\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir=\\\"RTL\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\"><strong>الخصائص والمزايا</strong></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\\\"RTL\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">تمويل يصل لغاية 3,000,000 درهم لمواطني دولة الإمارات العربية المتحدة</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">تمويل يصل لغاية 1,000,000 درهم للمقيمين</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">الحد الأدنى للراتب 6,500 درهم للمقيمين و8,000 درهم للمواطنين</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">فترة سداد تصل لغاية 4 سنوات</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">وثائق بسيطة</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">إجراءات سريعة</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">بطاقة ائتمان من مصرف عجمان &nbsp;مع مزايا لنمط الحياة</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p dir=\\\"RTL\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir=\\\"RTL\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\"><strong>الوثائق المطلوبة</strong></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\\\"RTL\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">نموذج طلب</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">نسخة من جواز السفر (مع تأشيرة الإقامة للمقيمين)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">نسخة من بطاقة الهوية الوطنية</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">شهادة راتب / خطاب تحويل راتب من جهة العمل</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">كشف حساب مصرفي للفترة بين 3 إلى 6 أشهر</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p dir=\\\"RTL\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir=\\\"RTL\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\"><strong>تمويل الديون المستحقة &ndash; فقط لمواطني دولة الإمارات</strong></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\\\"RTL\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir=\\\"RTL\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">تقدم خدمة التمويل الشخصي من مصرف عجمان إمكانية تسوية ديون مواطني دولة الإمارات من خلال تغطية كافة الاتزاماتهم وديونهم (ما عدا التمويل العقاري) لدى البنوك والمؤسسات المالية الأخرى وجمعها في حل تمويلي واحد وبسيط &ndash; \\\"تمويل الديون المستحقة\\\"، ما سيمنحهم فرصة الاستفادة من الدفعات الشهرية المنخفضة والحصول على السيولة. هذه الخدمة متوفرة من خلال خدمة \\\"مرابحة السلع\\\" التي تعتمد مبدأ&nbsp; المرابحة الإسلامية في عمليات التمويل</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\\\"RTL\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir=\\\"RTL\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\\\"RTL\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir=\\\"RTL\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\"><strong>الخصائص والمزايا</strong></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\\\"RTL\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">تمويل يصل لغاية 4,500,000 درهم</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">الحد الأدنى للراتب الشهري 20,000 درهم</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">فترة سداد تصل لغاية 25 سنة</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">وثائق بسيطةذ</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">إجراءات سريعة</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p dir=\\\"RTL\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir=\\\"RTL\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\"><strong>الوثائق المطلوبة</strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\\\"RTL\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">نموذج طلب</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">نسخة من جواز السفر (مع تأشيرة الإقامة للمغتربين) the product says UAE National Only???</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">&nbsp;نسخة من بطاقة الهوية الوطنية</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">شهادة راتب / خطاب تحويل راتب من جهة العمل</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">كشف حساب مصرفي لآخر 6 أشهر</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">رسالة الديون المستحقة على العميل من بنكه</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p dir=\\\"RTL\\\">&nbsp;</p>','','','murabaha','','','','','','','','',1,'2015-12-14','14 - December - 2015 11:36:54 AM',1,'17 - December - 2015 11:36:03 AM',1,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(141,0,1,'Cash out','Cash out','Cash out','','Cash out','Cash out',140,'','','','',1,0,0,'57k6480dhjnbpsw.jpg',1,'','','','','cash-out','','','','','','','','',1,'2015-12-14','14 - December - 2015 11:39:35 AM',NULL,NULL,1,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(142,0,1,'UAE National Takeover','UAE National Takeover','Takeover Finance – UAE Nationals Only','','UAE National Takeover','UAE National Takeover',141,'','','','',1,0,0,'',1,'<p>Ajman Bank Personal Finance offers consolidation of debts for UAE Nationals i.e. takeover all customer liabilities (except home finance) from other banks &amp; financial institutions to enjoy the lower installment and high liquidity. The facility is offered through Commodity Murabaha which is based on the Islamic financing structure of Murabaha,</p>\r\n<p><strong>Features</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Up to AED 4,500,000 finance for UAE Nationals</li>\r\n<li>Minimum Salary of AED 20,000</li>\r\n<li>Repayment tenor of up to 25 years</li>\r\n<li>Simple documentation</li>\r\n<li>Quick processing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Documents</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Application Form</li>\r\n<li>Copy of Passport (with Residence visa for expatriates)</li>\r\n<li>Emirates ID Card Copy</li>\r\n<li>Salary Certificate / Salary Transfer Letter from the employer</li>\r\n<li>6 months bank statement</li>\r\n<li>Liability Letter from existing bank</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Terms &amp; Conditions apply.</p>\r\n<p>Please call 800-22 for more details.</p>','','','','uae-national-takeover','','','','','','','','',1,'2015-12-14','14 - December - 2015 11:40:16 AM',8,'28 - March - 2016 03:20:39 PM',1,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(143,0,1,'Salary Transfer - UAE Nationals & Expats','Salary Transfer - UAE Nationals & Expats','Salary Transfer - UAE Nationals & Expats','','Salary Transfer - UAE Nationals & Expats','Salary Transfer - UAE Nationals & Expats',141,'','','','',1,0,0,'',1,'<ol style=\"list-style-type: lower-alpha;\">\r\n<li>Standard Personal Finance</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><strong>Personal Finance - Cash out</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>a) Expatriates (STL)</strong></p>\r\n<table border=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;Salary Transfer Customers - Govt., Semi Govt. &amp; T1<strong>&nbsp;</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Age&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;21-60*</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>&nbsp;Min Salary (AED)</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;6,500** p.m.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>&nbsp;Max Amount</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;Up to &nbsp;1,000,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>&nbsp;Max Tenure</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;48</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><strong>b) UAE Nationals (STL)</strong></p>\r\n<table border=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Age</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">21-65</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Min Salary (AED)</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">8,000*</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>LOS (Months)</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">3 Months</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Max Amount</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Up to AED 3 million</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Max Tenure (months)</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">48</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><strong>c) Settlement of Debts</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Features</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Up to AED 3,000,000 finance for UAE Nationals</li>\r\n<li>Up to AED 1,000,000 finance for Expatriates</li>\r\n<li>Minimum Salary of AED 6,500 for Expatriates &amp; AED 8,000 for UAE Nationals</li>\r\n<li>Repayment tenor of up to 4 years</li>\r\n<li>Simple documentation</li>\r\n<li>Quick processing</li>\r\n<li>Pre-Approved Credit Card with lifestyle benefits</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Documents</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Application Form</li>\r\n<li>Copy of Passport (with Residence visa for expatriates)</li>\r\n<li>Emirates ID Card Copy</li>\r\n<li>Salary Certificate / Salary Transfer Letter from the employer</li>\r\n<li>3 / 6 months bank statement</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Terms &amp; Conditions apply.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>','','','','salary-transfer---uae-nationals-and-expats','','','','','','','','',1,'2015-12-14','14 - December - 2015 11:41:07 AM',1,'16 - January - 2020 04:52:05 PM',2,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(144,0,1,'Goods Murabaha','مرابحة البضائع','Goods Murabaha','مرابحة البضائع','Goods Murabaha','مرابحة البضائع',139,'','','','',1,0,0,'7jmdhyk43b5pn16.jpg',1,'<p>Wants to change the house furniture? Or Need to buy the latest electronics &amp; gadgets? Wants to buy a Yacht for luxury outings? We will purchase the goods and sell them to you! Ajman Bank Personal Finance is always there for you.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Electronics &amp; home appliances</li>\r\n<li>Furniture</li>\r\n<li>Yachts, Boats &amp; Motorcycles</li>\r\n<li>Building material &amp; Machinery</li>\r\n<li>Any goods not prohibited by Shariah</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Features</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Up to AED 3,000,000 finance for UAE Nationals</li>\r\n<li>Up to AED 1,000,000 finance for Expatriates</li>\r\n<li>Minimum Salary of AED 6,500 for Expatriates &amp; AED 8,000 for UAE Nationals</li>\r\n<li>Repayment tenor of up to 4 years</li>\r\n<li>Simple documentation</li>\r\n<li>Quick processing</li>\r\n<li>Pre-Approved Credit Card with lifestyle benefits</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Documents</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Quotation of the required goods addressed to Ajman Bank</li>\r\n<li>Application Form</li>\r\n<li>Copy of Passport (with Residence visa for expatriates)</li>\r\n<li>Emirates ID Card Copy</li>\r\n<li>Salary Certificate / Salary Transfer Letter from the employer</li>\r\n<li>3 / 6 months bank statement</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Terms &amp; Conditions apply.</p>\r\n<p>Please call 800-22 for more details.</p>','<p dir=\\\"RTL\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">هل مللت أثاثك القديم وتود تغييره؟ أم هل ترغب بالحصول على أحدث الأجهزة الالكترونية؟ ولتربما تود أن تقتني أحد اليخوت الفاخرة، مهما كانت طبيعة السلع التي تود الحصول عليها فنحن في مصرف عجمان جاهزون لتلبية طلباتك من خلال خدمة تمويل مرابحة السلع، حيث سنقوم بشراء السلع وبيعها لك! التمويل الشخصي من مصرف عجمان متوفر دائماً لخدمتك. لقد أصبح بإمكانك الحصول على ما تريد من:</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">إلكترونيات وأجهزة منزلية</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">أثاث</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">يخوت، قوارب ودراجات نارية</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">مواد وآلات البناء</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">أي بضاعة لا تحظرها الشريعة الإسلامية</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p dir=\\\"RTL\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\"><strong>الخصائص والمزايا</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">تمويل يصل لغاية 3,000,000 درهم لمواطني دولة الإمارات العربية المتحدة</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">تمويل يصل لغاية 1,000,000 درهم للمقيمين</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">الحد الأدنى للراتب 6,500 درهم للمقيمين و8,000 درهم للمواطنين</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">فترة سداد تصل لغاية 4 سنوات</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">وثائق بسيطة</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">إجراءات سريعة</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">بطاقة ائتمان من مصرف عجمان &nbsp;مع مزايا لنمط الحياة</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p dir=\\\"RTL\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\"><strong>الوثائق المطلوبة</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">فتورة بسعر السلع المراد شراؤها موجهة إلى مصرف عجمان</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">نموذج طلب</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">نسخة من جواز السفر (مع تأشيرة الإقامة للمقيميين)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">نسخة من بطاقة الهوية الوطنية</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">شهادة راتب / خطاب تحويل الراتب من جهة العمل</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">كشف حساب مصرفي للفترة بين 3 إلى 6 أشهر</span></li>\r\n</ul>','','','goods-murabaha','','','','','','','','',1,'2015-12-14','14 - December - 2015 11:42:39 AM',1,'17 - December - 2015 11:32:25 AM',2,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(145,0,1,'Service Ijarah','خدمات الإجارة','Service Ijarah','خدمات الإجارة','Service Ijarah','خدمات الإجارة',139,'','','','',1,0,0,'d0b2k45rmtfngws.jpg',1,'<p>Wants to take family for a dream vacation? Or Wants to finance children education? Or suffering from an unexpected health condition? Or Needs advance rent? Or Want to finance your child\\\'s wedding? Ajman Bank Personal Finance offers all of the above though Islamic structure of Service Ijarah;&nbsp; a transaction where bank will purchase the service as requested by the customer and allow the customer, the right to use it and the benefits of the service for a predetermined period of time and in return the customer will pay a pre-determined agreed rent.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Features &ndash; (Except Education Finance and Hajj &amp; Umrah Finance)</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Up to AED 3,000,000 finance for UAE Nationals</li>\r\n<li>Up to AED 1,000,000 finance for Expatriates</li>\r\n<li>Minimum Salary of AED 6,500 for Expatriates &amp; AED 8,000 for UAE Nationals</li>\r\n<li>Repayment tenor of up to 4 years</li>\r\n<li>Simple documentation</li>\r\n<li>Quick processing</li>\r\n<li>Pre-Approved Credit Card with lifestyle benefits</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Terms &amp; Conditions apply.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Features &ndash;Education Finance</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Up to AED 750,000 finance for UAE Nationals &amp; Expatriates</li>\r\n<li>Minimum Salary of AED 6,500 for Expatriates &amp; AED 8,000 for UAE Nationals</li>\r\n<li>Repayment tenor of up to 4 years</li>\r\n<li>Simple documentation</li>\r\n<li>Quick processing</li>\r\n<li>Pre-Approved Credit Card with lifestyle benefits</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Terms &amp; Conditions apply.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Features &ndash;Hajj &amp; Umrah Finance</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>&nbsp;</strong>Up to AED 300,000 finance for UAE Nationals &amp; Expatriates</li>\r\n<li>Minimum Salary of AED 6,500 for Expatriates &amp; AED 8,000 for UAE Nationals</li>\r\n<li>Repayment tenor of up to 4 years</li>\r\n<li>Simple documentation</li>\r\n<li>Quick processing</li>\r\n<li>Pre-Approved Credit Card with lifestyle benefits</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Terms &amp; Conditions apply.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Documents</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Quotation of the required services addressed to Ajman Bank</li>\r\n<li>Application Form</li>\r\n<li>Copy of Passport (with Residence visa for expatriates)</li>\r\n<li>Emirates ID Card Copy</li>\r\n<li>Salary Certificate / Salary Transfer Letter from the employer</li>\r\n<li>3 / 6 months bank statement</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Please call 800-22 for more details.</p>','<p dir=\\\"RTL\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">أتود أن تأخذ أسرتك في رحلة لقضاء عطلة مميزة؟ أم هل تطمح بتقديم أفضل فرص التعليم لأبنائك؟ أو لربما كنت تعاني من مشكلة صحية غير متوقعة؟ أو أنك بحاجة لمبلغ الإيجار مقدماً؟ أو تريد أن تمويل حفل زفاف أحد أبنائك؟ لا داعي للقلق فسوف نقوم بالإجراءات اللازمة، فمنتج التمويل الشخصي من مصرف عجمان سيغطي كافة تلك الاحتياجت من خلال خدمات إجارة حيث سيقوم المصرف بشراء الخدمة وفقا لطلب العميل، من ثم إعطاء العميل حق استخدام هذه الخدمة والاستفادة منها ذلك لفترة محددة من الزمن على أن يقوم العميل بدفع الأجرة التي تم الاتفاق عليها مسبقاً.</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\\\"RTL\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\"><strong>الخصائص والمزايا - </strong>(باستثناء تمويل التعليم وتمويل الحج والعمرة)</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\\\"RTL\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">تمويل يصل لغاية 3,000,000 درهم لمواطني دولة الإمارات العربية المتحدة</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">تمويل يصل لغاية 1,000,000 درهم للمقيمين</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">الحد الأدنى للراتب 6,500 درهم للمقيمين و8,000 درهم للمواطنين</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">فترة سداد تصل لغاية 4 سنوات</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">وثائق بسيطة</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">إجراءات سريعة</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">بطاقة ائتمان من مصرف عجمان &nbsp;مع مزايا لنمط الحياة</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p dir=\\\"RTL\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\"><strong>الخصائص والمزايا </strong>&ndash; تمويل التعليم</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">تمويل يصل لغاية 750,000 درهم لمواطني ومقيمي دولة الإمارات</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">الحد الأدنى للراتب 6,500 درهم للمقيمين و8,000 درهم للمواطنين</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">فترة سداد تصل لغاية 4 سنوات</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">وثائق بسيطة</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">إجراءات سريعة</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">بطاقة ائتمان من مصرف عجمان &nbsp;مع مزايا لنمط الحياة</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p dir=\\\"RTL\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\\\"RTL\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\"><strong>الخصائص والمزايا </strong>&ndash; تمويل الحج والعمرة</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">تمويل يصل لغاية 300,000 درهم لمواطني ومقيمي دولة الإمارات</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">الحد الأدنى للراتب 6,500 درهم للمقيمين و8,000 درهم للمواطنين</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">فترة سداد تصل لغاية 4 سنوات</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">وثائق بسيطة</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">إجراءات سريعة</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">بطاقة ائتمان من مصرف عجمان &nbsp;مع مزايا لنمط الحياة</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p dir=\\\"RTL\\\" align=\\\"right\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">تطبق الشروط والأحكام</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\\\"RTL\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\"><strong>الوثائق المطلوبة</strong></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\\\"RTL\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">فتورة بسعر السلع المراد شراؤها موجهة إلى مصرف عجمان</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">نموذج طلب</span></li>\r\n<li style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"