demption value of approximately 2.5% of spend</p>\r\n<p>5)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Up to 100% cash withdrawal allowed</p>\r\n<p>6)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Priceless Arabia&nbsp;- You can enjoy the benefits of dining, shopping, entertainment, sports, travel &amp; attractions by simply registering your &lsquo;POWER&rsquo; credit card on <a href=\"http://www.pricelessarabia.com/\">www.pricelessarabia.com</a>. MasterCard&reg; terms &amp; conditions apply</p>\r\n<p>7)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Convert your retail purchase in equal monthly installments up to 6 months &lsquo;FREE OF MONTHLY FEE&rsquo;</p>\r\n<p>8)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; PIN &amp; CHIP security on all the retail purchases</p>\r\n<p>9) &nbsp; &nbsp;Up to 4 Free Supplementary Credit Card</p>\r\n<p>11) &nbsp; &nbsp;&ldquo;FREE&rdquo; Credit Shield Takaful Cover for the first 60 Days for New Credit Card Customers from the date of issuance</p>\r\n<p>12) &nbsp; &nbsp;Instant Online banking access</p>\r\n<p>13) &nbsp;&nbsp;3D Secured Online Purchase Transaction</p>\r\n<p>14) &nbsp;&nbsp;Global acceptability at more than 22 million locations worldwide through MasterCard&reg;</p>','','','','gold','','','','','','','','',1,'2015-12-14','14 - December - 2015 12:02:30 PM',1,'06 - May - 2019 11:00:35 AM',2,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(164,0,1,'Platinum','Platinum','Platinum','','Platinum','Platinum',162,'','','','',1,0,0,'79x8s620ctd4n3k.jpg',1,'<p><a href=\"../apply-online-now.html?a=45c48cce2e2d7fbdea1afc51c7c6ad26\">APPLY ONLINE NOW</a></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>1)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Earn 1 Power Points for every USD 1 spent on all purchases</p>\r\n<p>2)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Check and redeem your points at Powerful online portal.&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.ajmanrewards.ae/\">www.ajmanrewards.ae</a></p>\r\n<p>3)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Redemptions at</p>\r\n<ol style=\"list-style-type: lower-alpha;\">\r\n<li>More than 300 airlines</li>\r\n<li>More than 300,000 hotels</li