Publications/SIR_AR.pdf\">https://www.sca.gov.ae/Arabic/awareness/Publications/SIR_AR.pdf</a></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>','','','investor-support','','','','','','','','',1,'2015-12-14','14 - December - 2015 12:39:00 PM',1,'11 - June - 2020 01:39:49 PM',1,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(205,0,1,'Calendar','التقويم ','Calendar','التقويم ','Calendar','التقويم ',203,'','','','',1,0,0,'b2q1zh06f9xrty8.jpg',0,'<p><span>Check this section regularly for upcoming Board Meetings and General Assemblys dates.</span></p>','<p><span>تفضل بمطالعة هذا القسم بانتظام لمعرفة تواريخ اجتماعات مجلس الإدارة المقبلة والجمعيات العمومية.</span></p>','','','calendar','','','','','','','','',1,'2015-12-14','14 - December - 2015 12:39:34 PM',8,'20 - March - 2016 02:05:35 PM',2,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(206,0,22,'Property Finance','التمويل السكني','Home Finance','التمويل السكني','Property Finance','التمويل السكني',103,'property-finance.html','property-finance.html','','',1,1,0,'1f0y4gvx5zskhcm.jpg',1,'<p><span>Competitive profit rates, Flexible tenure</span></p>\r\n<p>Thinking of buying a new home? With Ajman Bank, you can look forward to innovative financial solutions to help you own your dream home.<br /><br /><strong>IJARAH &ndash; Ready Properties</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finance available in AUH, DXB, SHJ &amp; AJM</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Finance Amount up to AED&nbsp;10 million</li>\r\n<li>Maximum tenure up to 25 years</li>\r\n<li>Down payment of 20% for UAE Nationals and 25% for Expatriates</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Unique Feature: No developer restriction<br /><br /><strong>FORWARD IJARAH &ndash; Under Construction Properties (For UAE Nationals only)</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finance available in AUH, DXB, SHJ &amp; AJM</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Finance Amount up to AED&nbsp;10 million</li>\r\n<li>Maximum tenure up to 25 years</li>\r\n<li>Down payment of 50% for UAE Nationals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Unique Feature: Available to build or buy the under construction properties<br /><br /><strong>Home Finance 50-50</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finance available in AUH, DXB, SHJ &amp; AJM</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Finance Amount up to AED 5 million</li>\r\n<li>Maximum tenure up to 25 years</li>\r\n<li>Minimal documentation</li>\r\n<li>Faster Approvals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><br />Unique Feature: 1 month bank statement required only<br /><br /><strong>2nd Degree Mortgage</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finance available in AUH, Al Ain &amp; DXB</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Finance Amount up to AED 3 million&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Under this arrangement, UAE Nationals will avail Govt. Housing through following programs:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Sheikh Zayed Housing Program</li>\r\n<li>Mohammed Bin Rashid Est.</li>\r\n<li>National Housing Loan</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Way to Bank with us</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Walk in to our Branch</li>\r\n<li>Call us at 800 22</li>\r\n</ul>','<p>معدلات أرباح تنافسية وفترات حيازة مرنة</p>\r\n<div><strong>تفكر في شراء منزل جديد؟ مع مصرف عجمان يمكنك التطلع إلى حلول مالية مبتكرة لمساعدتك على امتلاك منزل أحلامك.</strong></div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div><strong>الإجارة ــ ممتلكات جاهزة</strong></div>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>التمويل متوفر في أبو ظبي ودبي والشارقة وعجمان</li>\r\n<li>تمويل يصل إلى 5 مليون درهم إماراتي بحد أقصى</li>\r\n<li>حد أقصى للحيازة حتى 25 سنة</li>\r\n<li>دفعة مقدمة 15% للمواطنين الإماراتيين و20% للمغتربين</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div>الميزة الفريدة: لا قيود من المطور</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>&nbsp;الإجارة المستقبلية ــ العقارات تحت الإنشاء (للمواطنين الإماراتيين فقط)</li>\r\n<li>التمويل متوفر في أبو ظبي ودبي والشارقة وعجمان</li>\r\n<li>مبلغ تمويل حتى 5 مليون درهم إماراتي بحد أقصى</li>\r\n<li>حد أقصى للحيازة حتى 25 سنة</li>\r\n<li>دفعة مقدمة 15%</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;مميزات فريدة: إمكانية بناء أو شراء العقار تحت الإنشاء</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div><strong>التمويل السكني: 50-50</strong></div>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>التمويل متوفر في أبو ظبي ودبي والشارقة وعجمان</li>\r\n<li>الحد الأقصى لمبلغ التمويل حتى 5 مليون درهم إماراتي</li>\r\n<li>الحد الأقصى للحيازة حتى 25 سنة</li>\r\n<li>الحد الأدنى من الوثائق المطلوبة</li>\r\n<li>موافقات سريعة</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div>مميزات فريدة: مطلوب بيان مصرفي لشهر واحد فقط</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div><strong>رهن من الدرجة الثانية</strong></div>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>التمويل متوفر في أبو ظبي ودبي والشارقة وعجمان</li>\r\n<li>الحد الأقصى لمبلغ التمويل حتى 3 مليون درهم إماراتي&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>بموجب هذه الترتيبات، سيستفيد المواطنون الإماراتيون من الإسكان الحكومي من خلال البرامج التالية:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>مؤسسة محمد بن راشد</li>\r\n<li>قرض الإسكان الوطني</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div><strong>للحصول على خدماتنا المصرفية</strong></div>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>تفضل بزيارة أحد فروعنا</li>\r\n<li>اتصل بنا على الرقم 22 800</li>\r\n</ul>','','','home-finance','','','','','','','','',1,'2015-12-14','14 - December - 2015 12:41:21 PM',1,'13 - January - 2016 10:36:15 AM',0,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(207,0,22,'Auto Finance','تمويل المركبات','Auto Finance','تمويل المركبات','Auto Finance','تمويل المركبات',103,'auto-finance.html','auto-finance.html','','',1,1,0,'z4kgbwp91dcvhy7.jpg',1,'<p><span>We offer auto finance to individuals and corporates through Islamic principal of Murabaha. As per our commitment we deliver your dream vehicle in quick and easy manner yet remain true to Shariah principles.</span></p>\r\n<p><span><strong>Main Features&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span><span>Most competitive rate&nbsp;</span><span>Available for new &amp; used cars</span></span></li>\r\n<li><span><span>Financing facility up to AED 500,000</span></span></li>\r\n<li><span><span>Financing tenure up to 60 months</span></span></li>\r\n<li><span><span>With or without salary transfer</span></span></li>\r\n<li><span><span>Simple documentation&nbsp;</span></span></li>\r\n<li><span><span>Quick approvals</span></span></li>\r\n<li><span><span>Special Offer for Affluent Customer for Exotic and&nbsp;</span><span>Luxury Car Finance</span></span></li>\r\n<li><span data-mce-mark=\"1\">Pre-approved Credit card for all Auto Finance&nbsp;</span><span data-mce-mark=\"1\">Customer</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span><strong>Auto Finance Basic Offer&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span><span>Finance available New Car and Used Car</span><span>With our without salary transfer&nbsp;</span></span></li>\r\n<li><span><span>Finance Amount up to AED 400,000</span></span></li>\r\n<li><span><span>Maximum tenure up to 60 Months</span></span></li>\r\n<li>Down payment 20% for new and used cars</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span><strong>Auto finance 50-50 Offer</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span><span>1 Month Bank Statement</span><span>Finance available New Car and Used Car</span></span></li>\r\n<li><span><span>Finance Amount up to AED 500,000</span></span></li>\r\n<li><span><span>Salaried and self-employed&nbsp;</span></span></li>\r\n<li>Processing Fees AED 500</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span><strong>Auto Finance Exotic Car Offer&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span><span>Finance Amount up to AED 500,000</span><span>Finance available New Car and Used Car</span></span></li>\r\n<li><span><span>With or without salary transfer&nbsp;</span></span></li>\r\n<li><span><span>Maximum tenure up to 48 Months</span></span></li>\r\n<li>List of Exotic Cars</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<table border=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Masarati</td>\r\n<td>Rolls Royce</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Bentley</td>\r\n<td>Ferrari</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Maybach</td>\r\n<td>Aston martin</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Lamborghini</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span><strong>Secured Finance Offer</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span><span>Finance available New Car and Used Car</span></span></li>\r\n<li><span><span>Finance up to AED 750,000 for New Car and AED&nbsp;</span><span>300,000 for Used Car</span></span></li>\r\n<li><span><span>Salaried and self-employed</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span><span>With or without salary transfer&nbsp;</span></span></p>','<p><span>نحن نقدم تمويل السيارات للأفراد والشركات وفقاً لمبدأ المرابحة الإسلامية. ووفقاً لالتزامنا، فإننا نوفر لك فرصة الحصول على سيارة أحلامك بطريقة سريعة وسهلة دون الإخلال بأحكام الشريعة الإسلامية.</span></p>\r\n<div>المزايا الرئيسية&nbsp;\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>المعدل الأكثر تنافسية</li>\r\n<li>متاح للسيارات الجديدة والمستعملة</li>\r\n<li>تسهيلات مالية تصل إلى 500.00 درهم إماراتي</li>\r\n<li>مدة قرض التمويل&nbsp; تصل إلى 60 شهراً</li>\r\n<li>عن طريق تحويل الراتب أو بدون تحويله</li>\r\n<li>بساطة التوثيق</li>\r\n<li>سرعة الموافقة</li>\r\n<li>عروض خاصة للعملاء الميسورين لتمويل السيارات المذهلة والفاخرة</li>\r\n<li>بطاقات ائتمان متفق عليها مسبقاً لجميع عملاء تمويل السيارات</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nالعرض الرئيسي لتمويل السيارات&nbsp;\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>تمويل السيارات الجديدة والمستعملة المتاحة</li>\r\n<li>عن طريق تحويل الراتب أو بدون تحويله</li>\r\n<li>يصل مبلغ التمويل إلى 400.000 درهم إماراتي</li>\r\n<li>تصل أقصى مدة للعرض إلى 60 شهر</li>\r\n<li>تمثل الدفعة الأولي نسبة 20% من المبلغ بالنسبة للسيارات الجديدة والمستعملة</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nعرض كومبو لتمويل السيارات والتمويل الشخصي\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>تمويل سيارات خاص بالمركبات</li>\r\n<li>تمويل شخصي خاص باستخدام العملاء</li>\r\n<li>التمويل متوافر للسيارات الجديدة والمستعملة</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;الحد الأقصى للتمويل الشخصي يصل إلى 80.000 درهم إماراتي&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>عرض تمويل سيارات 50-50\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>بيان شهري للبنك</li>\r\n<li>التمويل متوافر للسيارات الجديدة والمستعملة</li>\r\n<li>يصل مبلغ التمويل إلى 500.000 درهم إماراتي</li>\r\n<li>للعاملين بأجر والعاملين لحسابهم الشخصي</li>\r\n<li>رسوم إعداد 500 درهم إماراتي&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;عرض تمويل السيارات الغريبة&nbsp;\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>يصل مبلغ التمويل إلى 500.000 درهم إماراتي</li>\r\n<li>التمويل متوافر للسيارات الجديدة والمستعملة</li>\r\n<li>عن طريق تحويل الراتب أو بدون تحويله</li>\r\n<li>تصل أقصى مدة للعرض إلى 48 شهراً</li>\r\n<li>قائمة بالسيارات المذهلة</li>\r\n<li>مازارتي&nbsp; رولز رويس</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<table border=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>لامبورغيني</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p>رولز رويس</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>بنتلي&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;فيراري</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>&nbsp;مايباخ</td>\r\n<td>وأستون مارتن</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>عروض تمويل مضمونة</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>التمويل متوفر للسيارات الجديدة والسيارات المستعملة</li>\r\n<li>تمويل يصل إلى 750.000 درهم إماراتي للسيارات الجديدة و300.000 درهم إماراتي للسيارات المستعملة</li>\r\n<li>للعاملين بأجر والعاملين لحسابهم الشخصي</li>\r\n<li>عن طريق تحويل الراتب أو بدون تحويله</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>','','','auto-finance-1','','','','','','','','',1,'2015-12-14','14 - December - 2015 12:42:01 PM',1,'13 - January - 2016 10:37:41 AM',1,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(208,0,22,'Personal Finance','التمويل الشخصي','Personal Finance','التمويل الشخصي','Personal Finance','التمويل الشخصي',103,'personal-finance.html','personal-finance.html','','',1,1,0,'8cqgtd1svkxzjf0.jpg',1,'<p>There are many things that we want in life. Whether it is a highly coveted product, an exclusive service or an adventure of a life time, Ajman Bank Personal Finance can help you fulfill your dreams.</p>\r\n<div class=\"ms-rteThemeFontFace-2 ms-rteForeColor-1 ms-rteFontSize-3\"><strong>Personal Finance Amazing Offer</strong></div>\r\n<div class=\"ms-rteThemeFontFace-2 ms-rteForeColor-1 ms-rteFontSize-3\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"ms-rteThemeFontFace-2 ms-rteForeColor-1 ms-rteFontSize-3\"><strong>Starting from 3.99% p.a. !!</strong></div>\r\n<div class=\"ms-rteThemeFontFace-2 ms-rteForeColor-1\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"ms-rteThemeFontFace-2 ms-rteForeColor-1\">\r\n<div class=\"ms-rteThemeForeColor-2-2\"><strong>Personal Finance Campaign Features:</strong></div>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<div class=\"ms-rteThemeForeColor-2-2\">Amazing Offer from Ajman Bank</div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<div class=\"ms-rteThemeForeColor-2-2\">Personal Finance Starting from 3.99% p.a. reducing Balance</div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<div class=\"ms-rteThemeForeColor-2-2\">Processing fee of 1%, max AED 1,500</div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<div class=\"ms-rteThemeForeColor-2-2\">Maximum finance of AED 1 million for expatriates &amp; AED 3 million for UAE Nationals</div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<div class=\"ms-rteThemeForeColor-2-2\">Repayment tenor of up to 4 years</div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<div class=\"ms-rteThemeForeColor-2-2\">First Payment holiday of up to 90 days</div>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div class=\"ms-rteThemeForeColor-2-2\"><strong>Special Bundle offer with Personal Finance for Salary Transfer customers:</strong></div>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<div class=\"ms-rteThemeForeColor-2-2\">Pre-approved Credit with life style Benefits, plus 5,000 Bonus Points and First year annual fee waived</div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<div class=\"ms-rteThemeForeColor-2-2\">Free Job Loss Cover</div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<div class=\"ms-rteThemeForeColor-2-2\">Free Life Takaful</div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<div class=\"ms-rteThemeForeColor-2-2\">Current Account with no minimum balance requirement</div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<div class=\"ms-rteThemeForeColor-2-2\">Platinum Debit Card</div>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div class=\"ms-rteThemeForeColor-2-2\"><strong>Personal Finance available for non-salary transfer customers of up to AED 250,000</strong></div>\r\n<div class=\"ms-rteThemeForeColor-2-2\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></div>\r\n<div class=\"ms-rteThemeForeColor-2-2\"><strong>Bonus Points Eligibility:</strong></div>\r\n<div class=\"ms-rteThemeForeColor-2-2\"><strong>First Salary Credit in Ajman Bank account and minimum spend of AED 1000 on credit Card before subsequent month end. Cash Advance will not be considered in spend.</strong></div>\r\n<div class=\"ms-rteThemeForeColor-2-2\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></div>\r\n<div class=\"ms-rteThemeForeColor-2-2\"><strong>Job Loss Cover</strong></div>\r\n<div class=\"ms-rteThemeForeColor-2-2\"><strong>Involuntary Loss of Employment: Monthly Salary of AED 15,000 p.m. for up to 3 months, cover for up to one year from availing finance</strong></div>\r\n<div><strong>&nbsp;</strong></div>\r\n<div><hr /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ms-rteThemeFontFace-2\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"ms-rteThemeFontFace-2\"><strong>Personal Finance from Ajman Bank</strong></div>\r\n<div class=\"ms-rteThemeFontFace-2\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"ms-rteThemeFontFace-2\"><strong>Features &amp; Benefits</strong></div>\r\n<div class=\"ms-rteThemeFontFace-2\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>High Finance Amounts - upto AED&nbsp;4.5 million for UAE Nationals &amp; AED&nbsp;1 million&nbsp;for Expats</li>\r\n<li>Highly competitive rates</li>\r\n<li>Simple documentation</li>\r\n<li>Pre-approved Credit card</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<p><strong>Product Offering&nbsp;<br /></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Goods Murahaba<br /></strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"unIndentedList\">\r\n<li>Shariah compliant solution to avail goods:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Electronics &amp; home appliances</li>\r\n<li>Furniture</li>\r\n<li>Bikes &amp; motorcycles</li>\r\n<li>Boats &amp; Yachts etc.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul class=\"unIndentedList\">\r\n<li>Simple Process</li>\r\n<li>Repayment starts after delivery of goods</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Service Ijara</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"unIndentedList\">\r\n<li>Shariah compliant solution to avail Services:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Travel</li>\r\n<li>Medical</li>\r\n<li>Education</li>\r\n<li>Wedding</li>\r\n<li>House rent</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>Simple Process</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Secured Finance</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"unIndentedList\">\r\n<li>Fully Secured finance against End of Service Benefits and Term Deposits</li>\r\n<li>Fast and simple processing</li>\r\n<li>Minimal documentation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Way to Bank with us</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><img src=\"../files/visaprivArrow.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"230\" height=\"54\" /></strong></p>','<p><span>كثيرة هي الأشياء التي نسعى إليها في الحياة. سواء كان منتجاً عالي الأهمية، خدمة حصرية أو مغامرة استثنائية، فإن التمويل الشخصي من مصرف عجمان يمنحك فرصة تحقيق أحلامك.</span></p>\r\n<div><strong>المميزات والفوائد<br /><br /></strong></div>\r\n<div>فترات سدسد طويلة و أقساط مريحة<br /><br /></div>\r\n<div>بدون دفعةمقدمة<br /><br /></div>\r\n<div>خيارلفترة سماح<br /><br /></div>\r\n<div>لا رسوم للمعاملة ولا رسوم مخفية<br /><br /></div>\r\n<div>اجراءات مبسطة<br /><br /></div>\r\n<div>مع أو بدون تحويل الراتب<br /><br /></div>\r\n<div>نسبة ربح تنافسية<br /><br /></div>\r\n<div><strong>عروض المنتج<br /><br /></strong></div>\r\n<div><strong>1-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><strong>مرابحة البضائع<br /><br /></strong></div>\r\n<div>الإلكترونيات والمعدات المنزلية<br /><br /></div>\r\n<div>الأثاث<br /><br /></div>\r\n<div>اليخوت, الزوارق ,الدراجات و لنارية<br /><br /></div>\r\n<div>الحاسوب وملحقاته<br /><br /></div>\r\n<div>مواد البناء والآلات<br /><br /></div>\r\n<div>أي سلع أخرى غير محرمة شريعيا<br /><br /></div>\r\n<div><strong>2-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><strong>خدمة الإجارة<br /><br /></strong></div>\r\n<div>الحج والعمرة<br /><br /></div>\r\n<div>التعليم والتدريب<br /><br /></div>\r\n<div>مقدم إيجار المنازل<br /><br /></div>\r\n<div>باقات العطلات / تذاكر السفر<br /><br /></div>\r\n<div>رسوم المدارس والجامعات<br /><br /></div>\r\n<div>تكاليف الأعراس<br /><br /></div>\r\n<div>أي خدمات أخرى غير محرمة شريعيا<br /><br /></div>\r\n<div><strong>للحصول على خدماتنا المصرفية<br /><br /></strong></div>\r\n<div>تفضل بزيارة أحد فروعنا<br /><br /></div>\r\n<div>اتصل بنا على الرقم 22 800</div>','','','personal-finance-1','','','','','','','','',1,'2015-12-14','14 - December - 2015 12:42:32 PM',1,'13 - January - 2016 10:41:00 AM',2,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(209,0,21,'Credit Cards','بطاقات الائتمان','Credit Cards','بطاقات الائتمان','Credit Cards','بطاقات الائتمان',103,'','','','',1,1,0,'',0,'<p><img style=\"float: right;\" src=\"../files/credit.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"162\" height=\"175\" /></p>\r\n<p>We are delighted to announce the launch the most powerful multi partner Islamic Credit Card in UAE i.e. our &lsquo;POWER&rsquo; credit card.</p>\r\n<p>The &lsquo;Power&rsquo; credit card offers the best benefits which the customers have ever experienced with an Islamic credit card across the Banking industry in UAE.</p>\r\n<p>Customers can spend, earn &lsquo;Power&rsquo; rewards and get best returns / benefits on redeeming the their &lsquo;Power&rsquo; points through Power Credit Card rewards website <a href=\"http://www.abpowerrewards.ae/\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\">www.abpowerrewards.ae</span></a>. The &lsquo;Power&rsquo; credit card is offered in 3 categories</p>\r\n<p>1) Power &ldquo;World&rdquo; (with the maximum credit limit of AED 100,000) <br />2) Power &ldquo;Platinum&rdquo; (with the maximum credit limit of AED 65,000) <br />3) Power &ldquo;Gold&rdquo; (with the maximum credit limit of AED 35,000)</p>\r\n<p>So, the customers can use &lsquo;Power&rsquo; credit card anywhere within the UAE or Internationally to get rewarded for every purchase i.e.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium; color: #800000;\">Earn one &lsquo;POWER&rsquo; point for every USD </span><br /><span style=\"font-size: medium; color: #800000;\">spent on &lsquo;POWER&rsquo; credit card!</span></p>\r\n<p>So, the more you use your Ajman Bank Power credit card for retail purchases, the faster and greater your chances are to redeem your Power points against a variety of exciting options for yourself and your loved ones as below:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\">Incredible&nbsp;<strong>&ldquo;POWER&rdquo;</strong>&nbsp;Rewards!</div>\r\n<div>(<a href=\"http://www.abpowerrewards.ae/\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\">www.abpowerrewards.ae</span></a>)</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>&middot;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Online Redemption from anywhere in the world. Visit&nbsp;www.abpowerrewards.ae</div>\r\n<div>&middot;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;More than 900 airlines to almost any destination, any route &amp; any time!</div>\r\n<div>&middot;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>Stay at a hotel of your choice across 250,000 hotels</em></strong></div>\r\n<div>&middot;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Shop with Infi-shop and receive electronics &amp; more items right at your doorstep!</div>\r\n<div>&middot;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Reserve&nbsp;your seat at the most happening sporting events within UAE or Internationally!</div>\r\n<div>&middot;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Rent a car of your choice from 150,000 global car rental partners!</div>\r\n<div>&middot;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Experience the fine dining at select partners with accelerated Power Points</div>\r\n<div>&middot;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Redeem gift vouchers for your family and loved ones through Infi-Vouchers</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div><strong>Enjoy a unique collection of offers and experiences from MasterCard&reg;</strong></div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div><strong>Master Card Dining Offer</strong>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;Now you can enjoy up to 20% discount when you use your MasterCard POWER Credit Card from Ajman Bank at any of the &ldquo;Jumeirah Group&rdquo; 50 restaurants across the Emirates. This offer is valid till September 30, 2015<br />For more details about the offer, validity, participating restaurants and the applied term &amp; conditions, please click on the following link: <a href=\"http://www.jumeirah.com/en/offers/mastercard-summer-dining/\"><span style=\"color: #0072bc;\">http://www.jumeirah.com/en/offers/mastercard-summer-dining/</span></a>&nbsp;or call 80022</div>\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div><strong>Priceless Arabia&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br /></strong></div>\r\n<div>Especially created for MasterCard&reg; cardholders by MasterCard&reg;. You can enjoy the benefits of dining, shopping, entertainment, sports, travel &amp; attractions by simply registering your &lsquo;POWER&rsquo; credit card on <a href=\"http://www.pricelessarabia.com/\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\">www.pricelessarabia.com</span></a>. MasterCard&reg; terms &amp; conditions apply.</div>\r\n<div><strong>&nbsp;</strong></div>\r\n<div>Visit now and see what&rsquo;s available,</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>a. &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Log on to&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.pricelessarabia.com/\"><span>www.pricelessarabia.com</span></a></div>\r\n<div>b.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Sign up using Ajman Bank MasterCard &lsquo;Power&rsquo; Credit Card number</div>\r\n<div>Shop for experiences and offers available exclusively to MasterCard&reg; cardholders</div>\r\n<div><strong>&nbsp;</strong></div>\r\n<div><strong>Airport Lounge Access - Enjoy and unwind in a top-class lounge before your flight!</strong></div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>Get airport lounge access at the best lounges in the Middle East when you present your&nbsp;<strong>POWER World &amp; Platinum MasterCard<sup>&reg;</sup></strong>&nbsp;Credit Card from Ajman Bank and boarding pass at the following airport lounges</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div><strong>Dubai International Airport&nbsp;</strong><strong>&nbsp;|&nbsp;</strong><strong>Abudhabi International Airport</strong><strong>&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><strong>Saudi Arabia&nbsp;</strong><strong>&nbsp;|&nbsp;</strong><strong>Kuwait&nbsp;</strong><strong>|</strong><strong>&nbsp;Jordan&nbsp;</strong><strong>|</strong><strong>&nbsp;Eqypt</strong></div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div><a href=\"http://www.pricelessarabia.com/\"><span>MasterCard&rsquo;s&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\">Terms and Conditions</span><span>&nbsp;apply!</span></a></div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div><strong>The POWER Credit Card comes with more benefits as:</strong></div>\r\n<div><strong>&nbsp;</strong></div>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Convert your retail purchase in equal monthly installments up to 6 months &lsquo;FREE OF MONTHLY FEE&rsquo;</li>\r\n<li>PIN &amp; CHIP security on all the retail purchases</li>\r\n<li>Two Free Supplementary Credit Card</li>\r\n<li>Free i-Choose Credit Card for only online shoppers</li>\r\n<li>Credit Shield Takaful Cover</li>\r\n<li>Instant Online Banking access</li>\r\n<li>Secured Online Purchase Transaction</li>\r\n<li>Global acceptability at more than 22 million locations worldwide through MasterCard&reg;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div>\r\n<div><a href=\"http://www.ajmanbank.ae/en/retail-banking/consumer-finance/Documents/CrditCard%20Terms%20and%20Conditions.pdf\"><strong>Bank &amp; Partner Terms &amp; Conditions apply</strong></a><strong>&nbsp;</strong></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div><strong>ROADMILES CREDIT CARD</strong></div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>With Ajman Bank Credit Cards, you can now enjoy a new kind of financial freedom. Structured as per Shariah Islamic principles of Qard-a-Hasan and 100% Shariah compliant, the Ajman Bank Card is true to its values &amp; beliefs, while you enjoy the convenience of cashless shopping . A payment card product with a balance revolving facility to meet your day-to-day payment transactions, our Card helps you manage your expenditure better.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>A first in the UAE and a first for you. Ajman Bank proudly presents the ROADMILES Credit Card.</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>There are no other Credit Card Rewards like ROADMILES.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>It&rsquo;s simple, transparent and very rewarding. Just use your Ajman Bank Credit Card to earn ROADMILES. Your accumulated ROADMILES can be redeemed for Fuel Cards from Ajman Bank for any Petrol Station across the UAE.&nbsp;<br />&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div><strong>Why ROADMILES ?</strong></div>\r\n<div><strong>&nbsp;</strong></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>You drive on the roads every day, whether going to work, going home or going out with friends or family. Fuel makes up a part of your monthly expenditure. So, what better way to reward you than with ROADMILES that help pay for your fuel, reduce your transport costs and let you own the road!</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div><strong><img src=\"../files/lion.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"230\" height=\"248\" /></strong></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div><strong>It&rsquo;s easy to earn</strong></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>You earn ROADMILES with each and every purchase you make. For every AED 1 you spend, you earn 1 ROADMILE. So the more you spend, the more you earn. Supplementary Cards are also eligible for ROADMILES however the ROADMILES are credited to the Primary Credit Card.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div><strong>How to redeem your ROADMILES</strong></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>Simply call the Ajman Bank Call Centre and request to redeem your ROADMILES for your Fuel Card. Select the partner of your choice and the denomination you want and they will be delivered to your address via courier within 5 working days. ROADMILES are valid for a period of 2 years from the time they are accumulated.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div><strong>Minimum monthly spend</strong></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>Earning ROADMILES is subject to a low minimum monthly purchase. Both Primary and Supplementary Card purchases contribute towards the minimum monthly spend requirement. If you do not reach the minimum monthly spend, you will not be eligible for in that particular month.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<table style=\"width: 288px;\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><colgroup><col width=\"103\" /><col width=\"185\" /></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"xl71\" width=\"103\" height=\"21\"><strong>Card Type</strong></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl72\" width=\"185\"><strong>Minimum Monthly Purchase</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"xl69\" height=\"20\">Classic</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl70\">AED 500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"xl65\" height=\"20\">Premium</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\">AED 1,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"xl67\" height=\"21\">Platinum</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl68\">AED 2,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>Every 1 AED you spend entitles you to 1 ROADMILE. So what are you waiting for? Start using your Ajman Bank Credit Card and reward yourself with ROADMILES, the only Rewards that let you own the road!</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>For more information please call our 24 hour Call Centre on 800-22 or email us on</div>\r\n<div><a href=\"mailto:Roadmiles@ajmanbank.ae\">Roadmiles@ajmanbank.ae</a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Whatever the preference, we have a card for everyone.<strong>&nbsp;<br /><br /></strong></div>\r\n<div><strong>Product</strong>&nbsp;<strong>offering<br /></strong></div>\r\n<ul class=\"unIndentedList\">\r\n<li>Classic</li>\r\n<li>Premium</li>\r\n<li>Platinum</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div>Special cards designs for ladies</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<table class=\"creditcardtable\" style=\"border: 1px solid #f59b09; border-color: #990000; border-width: 1px;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"10\" cellpadding=\"10\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"../files/Creditcard.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"559\" height=\"194\" /></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Spend using Ajman Bank Credit Card at any local or international merchant on Electronics, Travel, Lifestyle, Education or at any retail shop of your choice and convert your retail transaction into equal monthly installments for 3 &amp; 6 months&nbsp;<strong><em>&ndash; &lsquo;Free of Monthly Fee&rsquo;</em></strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><br />\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n<table style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"background-color: #e35b1b;\">\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" width=\"432\">\r\n<div><strong>&lsquo;FREE OF MONTHLY FEE&rsquo;</strong></div>\r\n<div><strong>INSTALLMENT PAYMENT PLAN (IPP)</strong></div>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffcc;\">\r\n<td width=\"138\">\r\n<div><strong>&lsquo;FREE&rsquo;</strong>&nbsp;Installment Plan Tenor</div>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"135\">\r\n<div>Min. Purchase Transaction amount</div>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"159\">\r\n<div>Max. Purchase Transaction amount</div>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"138\">\r\n<div>3 Months</div>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"135\">\r\n<div>AED 1500</div>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"159\">\r\n<div>AED 15,000</div>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"138\">\r\n<div>6 Months</div>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"135\">\r\n<div>AED 7500</div>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"159\">\r\n<div>AED 15,000</div>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<div><strong><em>Special Promotion offer</em></strong></div>\r\n<div>&middot;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<em>Processing fee of 5% per transaction amount will apply</em></div>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<div><strong><em>What&rsquo;s more, you continue to enjoy 1 Roadmile on every AED 1 spent using Ajman Bank Credit Card!</em></strong></div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>Call Ajman Bank NOW&nbsp;at 800-22 and convert your transaction to&nbsp;<strong>&ldquo;FREE&rdquo; Installment Plan</strong>.</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div><a href=\"http://www.ajmanbank.ae/en/retail-banking/consumer-finance/Documents/Installment_Payment_Plan_T_n_C%20pdf.pdf\">Terms &amp; Conditions apply!</a></div>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #800000; font-size: medium;\"><