=\"94\">\r\n<p>80022</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"85\">\r\n<p>Dubai</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"139\">\r\n<p>Jumeirah</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"364\">\r\n<p>Jumeirah 3, Umm Suqeim 1</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"94\">\r\n<p>80022</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"85\">\r\n<p>Dubai</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"139\">\r\n<p>Garhoud</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"364\">\r\n<p>Red Avenue Building, Garhoud Area,</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"94\">\r\n<p>80022</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"85\">\r\n<p>Sharjah</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"139\">\r\n<p>Sharjah Buhaira</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"364\">\r\n<p>City Compass Building, Ground Floor, Corniche Area,</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"94\">\r\n<p>80022</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n<p><a href=\"../files/Ajman_Bank_PJS1_Right_Issues_Invite_2018_English_F.PDF\">Right Issue Invitation in English</a></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"../files/Ajman_Bank_PJS1_Right_Issues_Invite_2018_Arabic_F.pdf\">Right Issue Invitation in Arabic</a></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"../files/Project_Fort_-_English_FAQs.pdf\">FAQ\'s in English </a></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"../files/Ajman_Bank_-_Arabic_QA_-_071018.pdf\">FAQ\'s in Arabic</a></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"../files/AjmanBankRI18_FTSProcess_v2.pdf\">AjmanBank FTS Process</a></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"../files/AjmanBankRI18_FTSApplication_v1.pdf\">AjmanBank FTS Application</a></p>','','','','right-issues','','','','','','','','',1,'2016-05-29','29 - May - 2016 01:15:35 PM',1,'11 - June - 2020 01:34:16 PM',4,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(256,0,1,'EDM_GOLD','ذهب','','','EDM_GOLD','ذهب',0,'','','','',0,0,0,NULL,0,'<p><img src=\"../files/EDM_.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1570\" height=\"1735\" /></p>','','','','edm-gold','','','','','','','','',1,'2016-06-08','08 - June - 2016 10:51:29 AM',NULL,NULL,28,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(257,0,1,'E-Statement-5','كشف حساب5','','','E-Statement-5','كشف حسا ب5',0,'','','','',0,0,0,NULL,0,'<p><img src=\"../files/E-Statement-5.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"483\" height=\"455\" /></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"../files/E-Statement-8.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"483\" height=\"455\" /></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"../files/E-Statement-6.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"483\" height=\"455\" /></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"../files/E-Statement-7.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"483\" height=\"455\" /></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"../files/Home_Finance-01.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"431\" height=\"239\" /></p>','','','','e-statement-5','','','','','','','','',1,'2016-06-08','08 - June - 2016 02:25:17 PM',1,'09 - August - 2016 09:07:41 AM',29,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(258,0,1,'Invest Peacefully ','استثمر بأمان','','','Invest Peacefully ','استثمر بأمان',99,'','','','',1,1,0,'23sw5mhtk8rd1z6.jpg',1,'<p><strong>Invest </strong><strong>Peacefully</strong><strong> with Ajman Bank</strong></p>\r\n<p align=\"right\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>An opportunity to secure your investment and enjoy a free Life Family Takaful Cover offered throughout the deposit tenor!!</p>\r\n<p><strong><em>&nbsp;</em></strong></p>\r\n<p>Invest in a Mudaraba or Wakala investment term deposit and receive a free Life Family Takaful Cover.</p>\r\n<p>Additionally Customers with deposits of AED 1,000,000 and above will receive a free Family Travel Takaful Cover Valid for one year.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Eligibility Conditions:</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<table style=\"/*width: 654px;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"186\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><strong>Deposit Amount</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"150\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><strong>Tenor</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"318\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><strong>Entitlement</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"186\">\r\n<p>AED 100,000 or above</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"150\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">1 year and above</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"318\">\r\n<p>Free Life Takaful Cover equal to the amount of the deposit up to AED1,000,000</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"186\">\r\n<p>AED 1,000,000 or above</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"318\">\r\n<p>Additional Free Family Travel Takaful cover for one year.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>Limited Period Offer: Starting June 2016</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Terms and Conditions apply.</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>This promotion is open to all new and existing Consumer Banking customers of Ajman Bank.</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Takaful cover provided by Dubai Islamic Insurance and Reinsurance (Aman)</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For details call 800 22 or</p>\r\n<p>SMS&rdquo;INP&rdquo; to 6466---------</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"right\">&nbsp;</p>','<p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"RTL\"><strong>فرصتك للاستثمار مع مصرف عجمان</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>لإدخار أفضل ومستقبل آمن لعائلتك</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p dir=\"RTL\">استثمر في حسابات الودائع الاستثمارية بصيغة مضاربة أو وكالة، واحصل على تغطية (تكافل عائلي) مجانية</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\">كذلك سيحصل العملاء ممن يحتفظون بودائع بقيمة 1,000,000 درهم فأكثر ،على تغطية (تكافل على السفر) عائلية مجانية صالحة لمدة سنة</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>:شروط الأهلية</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"282\">\r\n<p dir=\"RTL\"><strong>المنافع</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"174\">\r\n<p dir=\"RTL\"><strong>مدة الوديعة</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"168\">\r\n<p dir=\"RTL\"><strong>مبلغ الوديعة</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"282\">\r\n<p dir=\"RTL\">تغطية \"تكافل عائلي\" مجانية مساوية لمبلغ الوديعة بحد أقصى 1,000,000 درهم.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"174\">\r\n<p dir=\"RTL\" align=\"center\">سنة واحدة أو أكثر</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"168\">\r\n<p dir=\"RTL\">100,000 درهم فأكثر</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"282\">\r\n<p dir=\"RTL\">&nbsp;تضاف أيضا تغطية تكافل على السفر عائلية مجاني لمدة عام.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"168\">\r\n<p dir=\"RTL\">1000,000 درهم فأكثر</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir=\"RTL\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>العرض لفترة محدودة, إبتداء من يونيو 2016</strong></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"RTL\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir=\"RTL\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong><strong>تطبق الشروط والأحكام</strong></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"RTL\">هذا العرض متوفر لجميع عملاء الخدمات المصرفية للأفراد في مصرف عجمان، الجدد والحاليين</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"RTL\">تغطية التكافل مقدمة من شركة دبي الإسلامية للتأمين وإعادة التأمين (أمان)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p dir=\"RTL\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir=\"RTL\">لمزيد من التفاصيل، يرجى الاتصال على الرقم 22 800 أو</p>\r\n<p dir=\"RTL\">إرسال \"INP \" إلى الرقم 6466 &nbsp;---------</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>','','','invest-peacefully-','','','','','','','','',6,'2016-06-12','12 - June - 2016 12:21:42 PM',1,'17 - February - 2020 09:55:33 AM',8,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(259,0,1,'ATLANTIS','اتلانتس','','','ATLANTIS','اتلانتس',0,'','','','',0,0,0,NULL,0,'<p><img src=\"../files/EDM_ATLANTIS-01.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"752\" height=\"837\" /></p>','','','','atlantis','','','','','','','','',1,'2016-06-14','14 - June - 2016 02:19:06 PM',NULL,NULL,30,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(260,0,1,' ','Ramadan & Eid Auto Finance Offer','','Ramadan & Eid Auto Finance Offer','Ramadan & Eid Auto Finance Offer','Ramadan & Eid Auto Finance Offer',99,'','','','',1,1,0,NULL,0,'<p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><strong>Celebrate the Holy Month of Ramadan with Ajman Bank. Get your <span style=\"font-size: medium; color: #800000;\">Auto Finance at 2.24% p.a.</span> Enjoy a <span style=\"color: #800000;\">pre-approved \"POWER\" Credit Card</span> &amp; <span style=\"color: #800000;\">FREE air-tickets</span> to many cities within GCC</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"font-size: small; color: #993300;\">Features:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Bundle offer&nbsp;profit Rates @ <strong>2.24%</strong>&nbsp;(flat per annum)&nbsp;for new cars and @ <strong>2.99%</strong> (flat per annum) for used cars</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Pre-approved &ldquo;<strong>POWER&rdquo; Credit Card</strong> with first year annual fee waiver and <strong>5000 &ldquo;POWER&rdquo; Points</strong> upon card&rsquo;s activation and <strong>minimum spend of AED&nbsp;1,000</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>&ldquo;POWER&rdquo; Points</strong> redeemable for air tickets to most cities within GCC and much more</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Option for first installment deferment up to <strong>90 days</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Standard Auto Finance processing fees will apply <strong>(1% of the finance amount- min AED 500 and max AED 2,500)</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Campaign period from <strong>7<sup>th</sup> June 2016 till 31<sup>st</sup> July 2016</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>','','','','ramadan-and-eid-auto-and-credit-card-bundle-offer','','','','','','','','',18,'2016-06-19','19 - June - 2016 12:26:53 PM',19,'03 - August - 2016 02:57:59 PM',33,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(261,0,1,'Auto Finance offer','عرض','','','Auto Finance offer','عرض',0,'','','','',0,0,0,NULL,0,'<p><img src=\"../files/EDMAuto_Finance_1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"752\" height=\"837\" /></p>','','','','auto-finance-offer','','','','','','','','',1,'2016-06-26','26 - June - 2016 01:48:18 PM',NULL,NULL,31,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(262,0,1,'Retail Mobile Banking - Help / Frequently Asked Questions','الأسئلة المتكررة','','','Retail Mobile Banking - Help / Frequently Asked Questions','الأسئلة المتكررة',0,'','','','',0,0,0,NULL,0,'<div class=\"login_container\"><!--container starts here-->\r\n<div class=\"contents_area\"><!--contents area starts here-->\r\n<h3><a style=\"font-size: 10px; background-color: #ffffff;\" name=\"top\"></a></h3>\r\n<h3>About Mobile Banking</h3>\r\n<br />\r\n<div><strong>1. What is Mobile Banking? <span style=\"color: orange; font-family: Ariel; font-size: small;\">&nabla;</span></strong></div>\r\n<div id=\"a1\" class=\"texter\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Mobile Banking is a simple, hassle-free and secure Banking service available to all Ajman Bank Retail banking customers.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><strong>2. Why to choose Mobile Banking? <span style=\"color: orange; font-family: Ariel; font-size: small;\">&nabla;</span></strong></div>\r\n<div id=\"a2\" class=\"texter\">You are looking for one reason to choose Mobile Banking, we will give you 10...\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>It is easy </strong>to apply, and <strong>hassle-free</strong> to use for your everyday banking needs</li>\r\n<li><strong>It is your own bank.</strong> You have instant access to up-to-date information on your accounts, deposits, credit cards and finance.</li>\r\n<li><strong>It is safe &amp; secure.</strong> Using your Online Banking ID (User ID) and Password, for viewing details of your accounts, cards, finances, and deposits,our Mobile Banking gives you the confidence that accounts and transactions remain safe with us.</li>\r\n<li><strong>It is fast.</strong> It takes a few seconds to click and to get updated information of your account,cards, finances and deposits, and a few minutes to make a bill payment, recharge your mobile or transfer funds.</li>\r\n<li><strong>It is worldwide access.</strong> You can use Mobile Banking from anywhere and at anytime, be it your home, office or on the move.</li>\r\n<li><strong>It is time-saving.</strong> No need to drive up to a branch or look for a service center. So you save up on your time to enjoy life.</li>\r\n<li><strong>It is available 24/7</strong> and accessible at your own convenience.</li>\r\n<li><strong>No special hardware or software required.</strong> All you need is a simple Smartphone (Iphone or Android) and an Internet connection.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Wide range of services.</strong> From account and card details, deposit details to finance summary, transfers, bill payments and mobile recharge, we have it all in one comprehensive package. And we are working vigorously to add more value-added services for you.</li>\r\n<li><strong>It is FREE!</strong> - Not that it matters much but feels good to know.\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><strong>3. What services are available through Mobile Banking? <span style=\"color: orange; font-family: Ariel; font-size: small;\">&nabla;</span></strong></div>\r\n<div id=\"a3\" class=\"texter\">The following services are available through Mobile Banking:<br />\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Accounts</strong>- Summary, Details and Last 10 transactions</li>\r\n<li><strong>Credit Cards</strong> - Details , Last 10 Transactions and Card Payment</li>\r\n<li><strong>Finance </strong>- View Finance</li>\r\n<li><strong>Deposits</strong> - View Deposits and Book a Deposit</li>\r\n<li><strong>Payment </strong>- Single bill payment and payment history</li>\r\n<li><strong>Transfer</strong> - Fund transfer to Own or Other Ajman Bank Accounts</li>\r\n<li><strong>Donation</strong> - Only available in Android</li>\r\n<li><strong>Service Request </strong>- Book a deposit and Cheque Book Request</li>\r\n<li><strong>Locate Us </strong>- By nearest ATM or Branch or in specific region</li>\r\n<li><strong>Contact Us </strong>- Contact the bank through different channels</li>\r\n<li><strong>Apply for new Products</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Promotions</strong> - New promotions currently running within the bank</li>\r\n<li><strong>Exchange Rates </strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><strong>4. What are fees and charges associated with use of Mobile Banking? <span style=\"color: orange; font-family: Ariel; font-size: small;\">&nabla;</span></strong></div>\r\n<div id=\"a4\" class=\"texter\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>There are no fees and charges for using Mobile Banking. However, some charges may apply to certain requests and transactions.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><strong>5. Is Mobile Banking available 24/7? <span style=\"color: orange; font-family: Ariel; font-size: small;\">&nabla;</span></strong></div>\r\n<div id=\"a5\" class=\"texter\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Yes. This service is available to you 24 hours a day, 7 days a week</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><strong>6. Can I access Mobile Banking from outside UAE? <span style=\"color: orange; font-family: Ariel; font-size: small;\">&nabla;</span></strong></div>\r\n<div id=\"a6\" class=\"texter\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Yes. As long as you meet the Requirements, you will be able to access Mobile Banking from anywhere and at anytime.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><strong>7. Can I access Mobile Banking from any type of mobile? <span style=\"color: orange; font-family: Ariel; font-size: small;\">&nabla;</span></strong></div>\r\n<div id=\"a7\" class=\"texter\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Yes. As long as you meet the Mobile Requirements, you will be able to access Mobile Banking from anywhere and at anytime.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><strong>8. Who can apply for Mobile Banking? <span style=\"color: orange; font-family: Ariel; font-size: small;\">&nabla;</span></strong></div>\r\n<div id=\"a8\" class=\"texter\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>To use Mobile Banking, you need to register on Online Banking with your Ajman Bank Debit Card or Credit Card incase if you dont have a User Id. You must have a Current or Savings Account, or a Credit Card with Ajman Bank.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><strong>9. How do I apply for Online Banking? <span style=\"color: orange; font-family: Ariel; font-size: small;\">&nabla;</span></strong></div>\r\n<div id=\"a9\" class=\"texter\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Click on the \' New User Register \' in main login page of Online Banking and follow the simple steps for registering. The registration for Online Banking will be completed online and you can log in to start using the Online Banking and Mobile Banking Services. Kindly visit www.ajmanbank.ae for new user registration.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3>Log - in</h3>\r\n<br />\r\n<div><strong>10. How do I apply for Mobile Banking? <span style=\"color: orange; font-family: Ariel; font-size: small;\">&nabla;</span> </strong></div>\r\n<div id=\"a10\" class=\"texter\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Customer needs to register for Online Banking on www.ajmanbank.ae and follow the simple steps for registering.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><strong>11. What is my User ID and Password for log-in Mobile Banking? <span style=\"color: orange; font-family: Ariel; font-size: small;\">&nabla;</span></strong></div>\r\n<div id=\"a11\" class=\"texter\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The User ID and Password is what you entered at the time of Registration.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><strong>12. What happens when my User ID is invalid? <span style=\"color: orange; font-family: Ariel; font-size: small;\">&nabla;</span> </strong></div>\r\n<div id=\"a12\" class=\"texter\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Please call our Phone Banking on 800-22 for assistance.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><strong>13. What should I do if I have forgotten my User ID? <span style=\"color: orange; font-family: Ariel; font-size: small;\">&nabla;</span> </strong></div>\r\n<div id=\"a13\" class=\"texter\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Just click on forgot User Id on login page of Online Banking and follow the instructions.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><strong>14. What should I do if I have forgotten my Password? <span style=\"color: orange; font-family: Ariel; font-size: small;\">&nabla;</span></strong></div>\r\n<div id=\"a14\" class=\"texter\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Just click on forgot Password on login page of Online Banking and follow the instructions.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><strong>15. How Can I change my password? <span style=\"color: orange; font-family: Ariel; font-size: small;\">&nabla;</span></strong></div>\r\n<div id=\"a15\" class=\"texter\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Yes, you can change your password any time. To change the password, login to Online Banking and then click on User Preference - Change Password on the left menu.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3>Security</h3>\r\n<br />\r\n<div><strong>16. How secure is Mobile Banking? <span style=\"color: orange; font-family: Ariel; font-size: small;\">&nabla;</span></strong></div>\r\n<div id=\"a16\" class=\"texter\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Security raises different concerns such as security of Retail information, security measures for identification, security of financial transactions and so on. Our Mobile Banking is one of the strongest encryption technologies and is used by numerous online financial applications worldwide for safeguarding information against disclosure to third parties.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><strong>17. What is encryption and information protected? <span style=\"color: orange; font-family: Ariel; font-size: small;\">&nabla;</span></strong></div>\r\n<div id=\"a17\" class=\"texter\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Encryption is the process of transforming information using an encryption algorithm to make it unreadable to anyone except those possessing special knowledge, usually referred to as a key. The result of the process is encrypted information. In many contexts, the word encryption also implicitly refers to the reverse process, decryption (e.g. \"software for encryption\" can typically also perform decryption), to make the encrypted information readable again (i.e. to make it unencrypted). And our SSL Certificate ensures encryption from your app to our back-end systems which protects information against any potential loss.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><strong>18. What precautions can be taken for using Mobile Banking? <span style=\"color: orange; font-family: Ariel; font-size: small;\">&nabla;</span></strong></div>\r\n<div id=\"a18\" class=\"texter\">You should take the following precautions:<br />\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>DO NOT reveal your Card Number, T-PIN, User ID and Password and Transaction Password to anyone.</li>\r\n<li>Keep changing your Password , and If you suspect it has been revealed, then change your Password IMMEDIATELY.</li>\r\n<li>DO NOT use easily guessable information as your Password such as your date of birth, telephone number, mobile number etc.</li>\r\n<li>DO NOT leave your Mobile unlocked or unattended when logged-in Mobile Banking.</li>\r\n<li>REMEMBER TO LOCK THE Mobile, LOG OUT of Mobile Banking and close the app.</li>\r\n<li>Call our Phone Banking immediately if you notice any unusual transactions on your account.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><strong>19. What should I do if I suspect unauthorized transactions on my account? <span style=\"color: orange; font-family: Ariel; font-size: small;\">&nabla;</span></strong></div>\r\n<div id=\"a19\" class=\"texter\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>If you suspect there are unauthorized transactions on your account, please call 800-22 on our Phone Banking by providing account and transaction details. Please take note of your last log-in date and time, as indicated at the MobileBanking Homepage, each time you log-in to Mobile Banking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><strong>20. What precautions should I take when using shared Mobile for using Mobile Banking? <span style=\"color: orange; font-family: Ariel; font-size: small;\">&nabla;</span></strong></div>\r\n<div id=\"a20\" class=\"texter\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>We strongly recommend that you do not access Mobile Banking and conduct transactions on other Mobile unless you are sure that it is safe to do so.\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p><!--contents area ends here--><!--footer Starts here--><!--footer Ends here--><!--container ends here--></p>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>','','','','faqmbeng','','','','','','','','',1,'2016-08-08','08 - August - 2016 10:10:23 AM',1,'08 - August - 2016 10:14:40 AM',32,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(263,0,1,'Banking Services Agreement',' اتفاقية الخدمات المصرفية','Banking Services Agreement',' اتفاقية الخدمات المصرفية','Banking Services Agreement',' اتفاقية الخدمات المصرفية',0,'','','','',0,0,1,'rbf79d82nh3qwxs.jpg',1,'<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"../files/Terms_Conditions.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Terms &amp; Conditions</a></p>','<p><a href=\"../files/Terms_Conditions.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Terms &amp; Conditions</a></p>','','','banking-services-agreement','','banking-services-agreement','','','','','','',19,'2016-09-04','04 - September - 2016 11:08:49 AM',19,'05 - September - 2016 11:23:15 AM',33,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(264,0,25,'UAE IBAN Format','UAE IBAN Format','UAE IBAN Format','UAE IBAN Format','UAE IBAN Format','UAE IBAN Format',0,'','','','',0,0,0,'sc8fzh5drvqw42k.jpg',1,'','','','','uae-iban-format','','','','','','','','',1,'2016-09-07','07 - September - 2016 09:38:45 AM',NULL,NULL,34,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(265,0,1,'Cash On Call','Cash On Call','Cash On Call','Cash On Call','Cash On Call','Cash On Call',161,'','','','',1,0,0,NULL,0,'<ul>\r\n<li>Convenience and flexibility to avail a cash advance with just one call to the Ajman Bank Call Center</li>\r\n<li>Avail up to 80% of the available credit limit as cash advance</li>\r\n<li>No paperwork required as application would be through phone</li>\r\n<li>Transfers can be made to Ajman Bank or any other bank account which the customer may have at other banks in UAE</li>\r\n<li>Nominal one-time fee for availing facility of only AED 150.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>','','','','cash-on-call','','','','','','','','',6,'2016-10-25','25 - October - 2016 03:29:45 PM',1,'14 - March - 2019 01:49:01 PM',5,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(266,0,1,'Investment Banking','الخدمات المصرفية الاستثمارية ','Investment Banking','الخدمات المصرفية الاستثمارية ','Investment Banking','الخدمات المصرفية الاستثمارية ',0,'','','','',1,1,0,'nwxbj01r9hg3k7y.jpg',1,'','','','','investment-banking','','Investment Banking','','','','','','',6,'2017-02-26','26 - February - 2017 12:48:02 PM',NULL,NULL,4,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(267,0,1,'Investment Solutions','حلول الاستثمار ','Investment Solutions','حلول الاستثمار ','Investment Solutions','حلول الاستثمار ',266,'','','','',1,1,0,'3zrnj01qh2xfp8b.jpg',1,'','','','','investment-solution-','','Investment solutions','','','','','','',6,'2017-02-26','26 - February - 2017 12:51:31 PM',6,'26 - February - 2017 01:50:32 PM',1,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(268,0,22,'Priority Banking ',' الأولوية المصرفية','Priority Banking ',' الأولوية المصرفية','Priority Banking ',' الأولوية المصرفية',266,'prioritybanking/priority-banking.html','http://website.ajmanbank.ae/site/prioritybanking/ar/priority-banking.html','','',1,1,0,'pwb07vd9yqn1fs8.jpg',1,'','','','','priority-banking-','','Priority Banking ','','','','','','',6,'2017-02-26','26 - February - 2017 12:54:09 PM',1,'11 - June - 2020 10:36:47 AM',2,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(269,0,1,'Alternative Investments','الاستثمارات البديلة','Alternative Investments','الاستثمارات البديلة','Alternative Investments','الاستثمارات البديلة',266,'','','','',1,1,0,'g4nwb2k61dzrjf5.jpg',1,'<p><strong>ALTERNATIVE INVESTMENTS BUSINESS</strong></p>\r\n<h1>Family Takaful</h1>\r\n<p>Takaful to help you protect those you love and look to the future with a strong sense of security. Stay covered and protected around the globe by choosing a customized plan according to your needs. With a little foresight and some advice income to your family can be guaranteed, If something happen to you</p>\r\n<p>Your Plan can be used to:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Make up for lost income</li>\r\n<li>Pay for children\'s education</li>\r\n<li>Clear any outstanding loans or credit cards</li>\r\n<li>Pay off the mortgage</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"125\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><strong>Saving &amp; Protection</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"125\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><strong>Medical Coverages</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"125\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><strong>Embedded Product</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"125\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><strong>Motor Insurance</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"125\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><strong>Property Takaful</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"125\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">Term Plans</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"125\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">DHA Plan</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"125\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">Invest in Peace</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"125\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">Comprehensive</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"125\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">Content</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"125\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">Whole Life</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"125\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">Female Care</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"125\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">Personal Belongings</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"125\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">Saving Plan</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"125\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">Male Care</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"125\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">Credit Shield</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"125\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">Third Party Liability</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"125\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">Building</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"125\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">Education Plan</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"125\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">Loss of Rent</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><strong>I. Saving &amp; Protection Plans </strong></p>\r\n<h1>a) Term Coverage</h1>\r\n<p>Pure Protection plan gives you the opportunity to protect your family&rsquo;s dreams and wellbeing should your unexpected death occur.</p>\r\n<p>This plan is affordable and offers a protection for your loved ones for a time period chosen by you provided you pay all your contributions.</p>\r\n<p>This plan can be well suited for short-range goals such as Takaful coverage to pay off a financing so that your loved ones dreams are not at stake in the event anything unfortunate happens to you.</p>\r\n<h1>b) Saving Plans</h1>\r\n<p>Saving plans designed to help you invest and save your money on a regular basis to meet your future financial needs. The plan offers various benefits</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Get started with a minimum of AED 200 per month</li>\r\n<li>Get life cover and critical illness</li>\r\n<li>Global coverage</li>\r\n<li>Affordable</li>\r\n<li>Liquidity</li>\r\n<li>Transparency</li>\r\n<li>Choose your investment funds</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h1>c)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Education Plans</h1>\r\n<p>This plan designed to help you invest and save your money on a regular basis to meet your child&rsquo;s future college educational expenses. The plan will protect you and your child from the covered unforeseen events that may occur to you or your child during the term of the plan. The company will pay a lump sum benefit in case of your death or disability and will ensure that the plan remains in force.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Monthly instalments starting from AED 200</li>\r\n<li>Continued Savings</li>\r\n<li>Both father and child are covered</li>\r\n<li>Unmatched flexibility</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h1>d)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Whole of Life plans</h1>\r\n<p>It&rsquo;s an investment-linked plan designed to provide cover for life. It provides Takaful cover which helps you to protect your loved ones financially for the whole of your life. The sum covered is paid to your loved ones following your death at any time. Highlights of the plan are as follows:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lifelong protection</li>\r\n<li>Plan available up to 99 years of age</li>\r\n<li>Flexible payment options of Monthly, Quarterly, Semi Annual or Annual contributions</li>\r\n<li>Minimum payment from as low as five years</li>\r\n<li>Additional protection with the option to choose additional riders</li>\r\n<li>Option to increase or decrease benefits at any contribution due date</li>\r\n<li>Worldwide coverage</li>\r\n<li>Inbuilt passive war risk</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>II. Medical Plans</strong></p>\r\n<h1>a) DHA Takaful</h1>\r\n<p>In line with the DHA&rsquo;s rollout of mandatory health insurance Ajman bank, is offering Mandatory Insurance for Dubai Residency issuance and renewal. The insurance is for Individuals and specifically tailored for spouses, dependents and domestic/basic workers with residential visas in Dubai. The product is in line with the continued rollout of the Dubai Health Authority&rsquo;s (DHA) mandatory health insurance scheme, which requires all Dubai visa holders to have access to medical insurance by 30 June 2016. The mandatory insurance provides visa sponsors with an affordable scheme which meets the DHA&rsquo;s Essential Benefits Plan requirements for employees earning AED 4,000 or less per month as well as domestics workers such as housemaids, drivers, cooks, nannies and gardeners.</p>\r\n<h1>b) Female Care Takaful plan</h1>\r\n<p>Female Care Takaful Plan is a Critical Illness plan designed to provide a lump sum Takaful benefit especially for the female customers by protecting against:</p>\r\n<p>1. First Ever Diagnosis of Female Cancer.</p>\r\n<p>2. Pregnancy Complications</p>\r\n<p>Benefits of the plan:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Simple &amp; Innovative Product.</li>\r\n<li>High Takaful Benefit Amount &ndash; Up to AED 200,000.</li>\r\n<li>Low Annual Takaful Contribution &ndash; Starting from AED 500 only.</li>\r\n<li>24/7 around the Clock Coverage.</li>\r\n<li>Simple enrolment Process &ndash; No Medical Examinations.</li>\r\n<li>Hassle Free Claims Settlement.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h1>c)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Male Care Takaful Plan</h1>\r\n<p>Male Care Takaful Plan is a Critical Illness plan designed to provide a lump sump Takaful benefit especially for the male customers by protecting against:</p>\r\n<p>1.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; First Ever Diagnosis of Critical illness.</p>\r\n<p>Benefits of the plan:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Simple &amp; Innovative Product.</li>\r\n<li>High Takaful Benefit Amount &ndash; Up to AED 200,000.</li>\r\n<li>Low Annual Takaful Contribution &ndash; Starting from AED 500 only.</li>\r\n<li>24/7 around the Clock Coverage.</li>\r\n<li>Simple Enrolment Process &ndash; No Medical Examinations.</li>\r\n<li>Hassle Free Claims Settlement.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong> III.Embedded Products</strong></p>\r\n<h1>a)Invest in Peace</h1>\r\n<p><em>An opportunity to secure your investment and enjoy free Life Family Takaful Cover offered throughout the deposit* tenor!! </em></p>\r\n<p>Invest in a Mudaraba or Wakala term deposit and receive a free Life Family Takaful Cover.</p>\r\n<p>Additionally, customers with deposits of AED 1,000,000 and above will receive a free Travel Takaful Cover.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Eligibility Conditions: </strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Invest in a deposit of AED 100,000 or above and receive a free Life Takaful Cover equal to the amount of your deposit, up to an amount of AED 1,000,000.</li>\r\n<li>Invest in a deposit of AED 1,000,000 or above and also receive a free Travel Takaful Cover for yourself and up to 5 family members.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><em>*Limited period offer, starting 26th May 2016.</em></p>\r\n<h1>b) Credit Shield</h1>\r\n<p>Credit Shield protection gives you the option to have the outstanding balance on your Credit Card waived in case of some unforeseen circumstances of loss of life due to any cause and permanent disability.</p>\r\n<p>Ajman Bank also is offering the benefit of involuntary loss of employment and Critical illness cover along with the basic death and disability cover. The cover for the first two months will be free for the customers and it will be chargeable going forward.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Convenient Payment Option:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Once you enroll for Credit Shield, your subscription will be automatically renewed for a monthly fee of 0.6% of your monthly outstanding balance. The fee will be conveniently billed through your Credit Card. This amount will be reflected in your monthly Credit Card Statement.</p>\r\n<p><strong>The Benefits under the product:</strong></p>\r\n<h1>Death due to any cause (Death) and Permanent Total Disability (PTD)</h1>\r\n<p>In the event of the death or the Permanent Total Disablement of a cardholder due to injury or illness arising out of a cause not specifically excluded under this policy after the Commencement Date and during the policy period, Takaful Provider shall indemnify the bank the actual outstanding balance amount including accrued profit as at date of event subject to a maximum of AED 100,000/- per customer.</p>\r\n<h1>Critical Illness</h1>\r\n<p>In the event of a Cardholder being diagnosed with one or more of the Critical illnesses covered after the commencement date and during the agreement period, Takaful Provider shall indemnify the Bank the actual outstanding balance amount including accrued profit as at the date of event subject to a maximum of 120% of the Credit Limit and subject to an overall cap of AED 100,000/- per customer. Critical illness covered under this section are; Heart Attack, Stroke, Kidney failure, Coronary Artery Bypass Surgery, Cancer, Major Organ Transplant and Multiple sclerosis</p>\r\n<h1>Involuntary Loss of Employment (ILOE)</h1>\r\n<p>In the event of involuntary unemployment of a Cardholder after the commencement date and during the agreement period, Takaful Provider shall indemnify the Bank 10% of the actual outstanding balance as on the date of notice of termination served to the Cardholder, subject to a maximum of AED 4,000/- per month, subject to a maximum of 12 months, i.e. AED 48,000/- in all per Cardholder.</p>\r\n<h1>Purchase Protection</h1>\r\n<p>In the event of a Covered Purchase being stolen or damaged means during the covered period Takaful Provider shall pay the amount of the Covered Purchase indicated on the Eligible account; or the actual cost to repair or replace the Covered Purchase with an item of like kind and quality.</p>\r\n<h1>Extended Warranty</h1>\r\n<p>To indemnify the cardholders of the assured if the items purchased anywhere in the world with the aid of the Insured&rsquo;s issued credit cards:</p>\r\n<p>Would have been subject to a claim under the original manufacturer&rsquo;s warranty, if the loss had occurred within the manufacturer&rsquo;s warranty, if the loss had occurred within the manufacturer&rsquo;s original warranty period. Period of this coverage would be the double the manufacturer&rsquo;s warranty but no more than 24 months from the original date of purchase.</p>\r\n<h1>Secure Wallet</h1>\r\n<p>In the event of the wallet of the Cardholder is being lost or stolen anywhere in the world; Takaful Provider will indemnify any loss other than those specifically excluded as a result of misuse of the Credit Card(s) issued within UAE in the wallet by any unauthorized person subject to a maximum of AED 10,000/- during the agreement period. However losses incurred within 48 hours prior to the time the wallet is reported lost or stolen only will be covered.</p>\r\n<p>7-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h1>Credit Card Travel Accident</h1>\r\n<p>In the event of any emergency medical expenses, Takaful provider will indemnify the card holder in respect of the emergency medical expenses consequent covered trip.</p>\r\n<p><strong>General Takaful</strong></p>\r\n<h1>1.Motor Takaful</h1>\r\n<h1>Drive with peace of mind</h1>\r\n<p>Whether you need to insure your first car or renew your existing car insurance, Ajman bank is providing car insurance policies from the Best Takaful service providers in the market to suit your requirements and offer great product benefits.</p>\r\n<h1>Advantages</h1>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy payment plan</li>\r\n<li>Comprehensive cover</li>\r\n<li>Replacement of vehicle service at nominal cost</li>\r\n<li>AAA , Road - side assistance 24 hours a day, 7 days a week, free of cost.</li>\r\n<li>Fast claim processing</li>\r\n<li>No deductible in case insured /driver is not at fault if claim is recoverable</li>\r\n<li>Cover for injury to the Driver &amp; to the Passengers</li>\r\n<li>Door to Door car registration renewal service at nominal cost</li>\r\n<li>Coverage is extended to include riots, strike and civil commotions</li>\r\n<li>Off road cover for 4X4 Vehicles at nominal cost</li>\r\n<li>Agency repair for two years from first registration as new subject to a satisfactory claim ratio</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h1>2.Property All Risk Takaful</h1>\r\n<p>Buying is an overwhelming experience for individuals. The property all risk cover policy provides all risk coverage to property whilst situated at the described premises against loss and/or damage due to any accident or misfortune.</p>','','','','alternative-investments','','Alternative Investments','','','','','','',6,'2017-02-26','26 - February - 2017 01:34:28 PM',1,'12 - May - 2020 03:38:59 PM',3,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00');
