so-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Cambria; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Kartika; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\" lang=\"AR-SA\" dir=\"rtl\">90%</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 196.25pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-themecolor: text1; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-right-themecolor: text1; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-top-themecolor: text1; mso-border-left-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-left-themecolor: text1; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-themecolor: text1; background: #D9D9D9; mso-background-themecolor: background1; mso-background-themeshade: 217; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 24.6pt;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"262\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: right; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 78.75pt; mso-element: frame; mso-element-frame-hspace: 9.0pt; mso-element-wrap: around; mso-element-anchor-vertical: paragraph; mso-element-anchor-horizontal: page; mso-element-left: 326.3pt; mso-element-top: 18.9pt; mso-height-rule: exactly;\" align=\"right\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Century Gothic\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Century Gothic\'; mso-bidi-language: AR-AE;\" lang=\"AR-AE\" dir=\"rtl\">حصة المضارب من الأرباح (كحد أقصى)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>','','','weightages-and-mudareb-share-','','','','','','','','',6,'2017-04-13','13 - April - 2017 09:06:42 AM',1,'16 - June - 2020 12:59:09 PM',3,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(271,0,1,'Tariff of Charges','رسوم خدمة العملاء - أفراد','Tariff of Charges','رسوم خدمة العملاء - أفراد','Tariff of Charges','رسوم خدمة العملاء - أفراد',99,'','','','',1,1,0,'mcrq9wn3pz208v6.jpg',1,'<!--<div class=\"downloadbtn\"><a href=\"../files/Tariffofcharges2017.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Download<img src=\"images/download.png\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"../files/31.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"697\" /><img src=\"../files/32.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"799\" height=\"702\" /><img src=\"../files/34.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"801\" height=\"547\" /><img src=\"../files/35.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"539\" /><img src=\"../files/36.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"799\" height=\"743\" /><img src=\"../files/37.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"446\" /></p>-->','<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"../files/31.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"697\" /><img src=\"../files/32.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"799\" height=\"702\" /><img src=\"../files/34.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"801\" height=\"547\" /><img src=\"../files/35.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"539\" /><img src=\"../files/36.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"799\" height=\"743\" /><img src=\"../files/37.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"446\" /></p>','','','tariff-of-charges---retail','','','','','','','','',6,'2017-05-02','02 - May - 2017 03:12:33 PM',1,'20 - April - 2020 02:00:07 PM',35,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(272,0,1,'MAP','    ماب','MAP','ماب','MAP','   ماب',133,'','','','',1,0,0,'r0ykfm67h9z2sbn.png',1,'<p>MAP is an unmatched mortgage finance that makes home ownership really affordable. With initial low investments you can move into your <strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">ready home</span></strong> and pay really <strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">low installments</span></strong>:</p>\r\n<p>Pay as low as AED 468* monthly installment towards your ready to move in <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>home&nbsp;in a developed community</strong></span>.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"../files/123.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"672\" height=\"132\" /></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>* Terms &amp; Conditions apply<br /> ** First year estimated installments</p>\r\n<p>Pay as low as AED 3274* monthly installment towards your ready to move in<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong> Luxury home&nbsp;in a developed community</strong></span>.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"../files/1234.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"674\" height=\"104\" /></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>* Terms &amp; Conditions apply<br /> ** First year estimated installments</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Features &amp; Benefits</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Low Risk</li>\r\n<li>Low initial investment</li>\r\n<li>Low monthly installments</li>\r\n<li>Ready to move in quality home</li>\r\n<li>Maximum finance tenor&nbsp; of 25 years</li>\r\n<li>Maximum finance amounts up to AED 10,000,000</li>\r\n<li>Maximum finance to loan value of 80%*.</li>\r\n<li>Minimal documentation and fast processing</li>\r\n<li>Competitive profit rates</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Apply today! Call 80022</strong></p>\r\n<p>You may even visit our branches or our website for further details</p>\r\n<p>*Terms &amp; Conditions Apply</p>\r\n<p>**First year estimated instalments</p>\r\n<p dir=\"RTL\">&nbsp;</p>','<p dir=\"RTL\">ماب هو برنامج تمويل عقاري فريد من نوعه ، يُمكنك من إمتلاك منزلك &nbsp;الخاص بأسعار ميسرة، &nbsp;ومن خلال &nbsp;أقل دفعة استثمار أولي ، يمكنك الانتقال إلى <strong>منزلك الجديد</strong> &nbsp;مع دفع أقل <strong>معدل أقساط شهرية ممكن.</strong></p>\r\n<p dir=\"RTL\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir=\"RTL\">ادفع أقل قسط شهري يصل الى 468 درهم * &nbsp;، &nbsp;وكن جاهزاً للانتقال إلى <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>منزلك الجديد</strong></span><strong>.</strong></p>\r\n<p dir=\"RTL\"><strong><img src=\"../files/1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"677\" height=\"132\" /></strong></p>\r\n<p dir=\"RTL\">ادفع أقل قسط شهري يصل الى 3274 درهم * &nbsp;، &nbsp;وكن جاهزاً للانتقال إلى أحد <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>المنازل الفاخرة</strong></span>.</p>\r\n<p dir=\"RTL\"><img src=\"../files/2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"678\" height=\"106\" /></p>\r\n<p dir=\"RTL\"><strong>الخصائص والميزات</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"RTL\">أقل درجة مخاطر</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"RTL\">دفعة الاستثمار الأولي منخفضة</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"RTL\">دفعات شهرية منخفضة</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"RTL\">الانتقال مباشرة إلى المنزل</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"RTL\">مدة تمويل تصل إلى &nbsp;25 عاماً</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"RTL\">مبالغ تمويل تصل حتى 10.000.000 درهم</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"RTL\">تمويل يصل حتى 80٪ من قيمة العقار *</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"RTL\">الحد الأدنى من المستندات والوثائق والمعالجة السريعة للطلب</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"RTL\">معدل ربحية تنافسي</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p dir=\"RTL\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir=\"RTL\"><strong>سجل طلبك الأن! واتصل بنا على الرقم &nbsp;80022</strong></p>\r\n<p dir=\"RTL\">لمزيد من المعلومات ! يمكنك زيارة أي من فروعنا أو موقعنا على شبكة الانترنت</p>\r\n<p dir=\"RTL\">*تطبّق الشروط والأحكام</p>\r\n<p dir=\"RTL\">**دفعات الأقساط المقدرة خلال السنة الأولى&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir=\"RTL\">&nbsp;</p>','','','map','','','','','','','','',6,'2017-05-16','16 - May - 2017 03:15:10 PM',1,'11 - June - 2020 12:28:38 PM',5,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(273,0,22,'Offers','  ','','','Offers','  ',103,'','','','',1,1,0,'0n9zwg351y4jfvh.jpg',1,'','','','','offers','','','','','','','','',6,'2017-06-13','13 - June - 2017 11:27:59 AM',NULL,NULL,15,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(274,0,1,'Ramadan Exclusive Offer','   ','','','Ramadan Exclusive Offer','   ',273,'','','','',1,0,0,NULL,0,'<h4><strong>Enjoy exclusive discounts on your Ajman Bank Debit and Credit Cards and share special moments with your loved ones during this month.</strong></h4>\r\n<p><img src=\"../files/ramadan_Exclusive_Offer_4.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"628\" height=\"492\" />&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Offer Details:</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Offers are applicable only on Shariah compliant services</li>\r\n<li>Partner terms and conditions apply</li>\r\n<li>Ajman Bank Credit Card offers can be availed on Ajman Bank Power Traveller Mobile application.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Download and Register:</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Download Ajman Bank Power Traveller from Apple Store (iOS) or from the Play Store (Andriod)</li>\r\n<li>Register using your name, email and mobile number</li>\r\n<li>Enter the membership number. If you do not have your membership number, call us at 800 22.</li>\r\n</ul>','','','','ramadan-exclusive-offer','','','','','','','','',6,'2017-06-13','13 - June - 2017 11:43:02 AM',1,'21 - November - 2017 11:34:36 AM',2,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(275,0,1,'i win','  ','','','i win','  ',273,'','','','',1,0,0,NULL,0,'<p><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>iWin Savings Account </strong></span></p>\r\n<p>The more you deposit the more you win!</p>\r\n<p>Now save and become a millionaire with our Shariah compliant iWin Savings Account! It&rsquo;s a simple savings account that will automatically enroll you in our draws.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Features &amp; Benefits </strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&bull; iWin Saving Account can be opened with AED 1,000 or more</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Account will be operated under the Islamic concept of&nbsp; Mudarabah</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Average balance per quarter of AED 1,000 should be maintained to be eligible for the draw</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Every AED 1,000 quarterly balance qualifies for one Raffle draw</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Joint account(s) are allowed&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Documents Required </strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&bull; Duly filled and signed Account Opening Form and &nbsp;Terms &amp; Conditions</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Original and copy of Emirates ID for UAE nationals and expatriates</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Original and copy of Passport with VISA page for expatriates</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Terms &amp; Conditions Apply.</strong></span></p>','','','','i-win','','','','','','','','',6,'2017-06-14','14 - June - 2017 02:31:02 PM',1,'31 - May - 2018 02:05:05 PM',1,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(276,0,1,'Credit Shield','   ','','','Credit Shield','  ',161,'','','','',1,0,0,'42w0mfphsvz58kg.jpg',1,'<p>Credit Shield protection gives you the option to have the outstanding balance on your Credit Card waived in case of some unforeseen circumstances of loss of life due to any cause and permanent disability.</p>\r\n<p>Ajman Bank also is offering the benefit of involuntary loss of employment and Critical illness cover along with the basic death and disability cover. The cover for the first two months will be free for the customers and it will be chargeable going forward.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Convenient Payment Option:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Once you enrol for Credit Shield, your subscription will be automatically renewed for a monthly fee of 0.89% of your monthly outstanding balance. The fee will be conveniently billed through your Credit Card. This amount will be reflected in your monthly Credit Card Statement.</p>\r\n<p><strong>The Benefits under the product:</strong></p>\r\n<p>1-Death due to any cause (Death) and Permanent Total Disability (PTD)</p>\r\n<p>In the event of the death or the Permanent Total Disablement of a cardholder due to injury or illness arising out of a cause not specifically excluded under this policy after the Commencement Date and during the policy period, Takaful Provider shall indemnify the bank the actual outstanding balance amount including accrued profit as at date of event subject to a maximum of AED 100,000/- per customer.</p>\r\n<p>2-Critical Illness</p>\r\n<p>In the event of a Cardholder being diagnosed with one or more of the Critical illnesses covered after the commencement date and during the agreement period, Takaful Provider shall indemnify the Bank the actual outstanding balance amount including accrued profit as at the date of event subject to a maximum of 120% of the Credit Limit and subject to an overall cap of AED 100,000/- per customer. Critical illness covered under this section are; Heart Attack, Stroke, Kidney failure, Coronary Artery Bypass Surgery, Cancer, Major Organ Transplant and Multiple sclerosis</p>\r\n<p>3-Involuntary Loss of Employment (ILOE)</p>\r\n<p>In the event of involuntary unemployment of a Cardholder after the commencement date and during the agreement period, Takaful Provider shall indemnify the Bank 10% of the actual outstanding balance as on the date of notice of termination served to the Cardholder, subject to a maximum of AED 4,000/- per month, subject to a maximum of 12 months, i.e. AED 48,000/- in all per Cardholder.</p>\r\n<p>4-Purchase Protection</p>\r\n<p>In the event of a Covered Purchase being stolen or damaged means during the covered period Takaful Provider shall pay the amount of the Covered Purchase indicated on the Eligible account; or the actual cost to repair or replace the Covered Purchase with an item of like kind and quality.</p>\r\n<p>5-Extended Warranty</p>\r\n<p>To indemnify the cardholders of the assured if the items purchased anywhere in the world with the aid of the Insured&rsquo;s issued credit cards:</p>\r\n<p>Would have been subject to a claim under the original manufacturer&rsquo;s warranty, if the loss had occurred within the manufacturer&rsquo;s warranty, if the loss had occurred within the manufacturer&rsquo;s original warranty period. Period of this coverage would be the double the manufacturer&rsquo;s warranty but no more than 24 months from the original date of purchase.</p>\r\n<p>6-Secure Wallet</p>\r\n<p>In the event of the wallet of the Cardholder is being lost or stolen anywhere in the world; Takaful Provider will indemnify any loss other than those specifically excluded as a result of misuse of the Credit Card(s) issued within UAE in the wallet by any unauthorized person subject to a maximum of AED 10,000/- during the agreement period. However losses incurred within 48 hours prior to the time the wallet is reported lost or stolen only will be covered.</p>\r\n<p>7-Credit Card Travel Accident</p>\r\n<p>In the event of any emergency medical expenses, Takaful provider will indemnify the card holder in respect of the emergency medical expenses consequent covered trip.</p>','','','','credit-shield','','','','','','','','',6,'2017-06-18','18 - June - 2017 10:41:44 AM',1,'16 - January - 2020 05:19:59 PM',6,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(279,0,1,'iWin Winners','iWin Winners','iWin Winners','iWin Winners','iWin Winners','iWin Winners',275,'','','','',1,1,0,NULL,0,'<table style=\"width: 584px;\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><colgroup> <col width=\"72\" /> <col width=\"268\" /> <col width=\"160\" /> <col width=\"84\" /></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"xl70\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"584\" height=\"23\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: #ffcc99;\"><em>&nbsp;Grand Winner of 1 Million Dirhams</em></span></strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"xl65\" width=\"72\" height=\"23\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Sr</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl65\" width=\"268\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Customer Name</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl65\" width=\"160\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Nationality</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl65\" width=\"84\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Amount</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\" height=\"23\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">1</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl67\" width=\"268\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">OBAID MATAR ALI JUZAIEE ALKTEBI</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"160\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">UNITED ARAB EMIRATES</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl68\" width=\"84\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">1,000,000</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"xl70\" colspan=\"4\" height=\"23\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong><span style=\"background