idth=\"358\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">Omeir Travel Agency</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"199\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">AED 1,500</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"97\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">13</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"358\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">Anta Travel</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"199\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">AED 7,000 (Packages only)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"97\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">14</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"358\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">Eros</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"199\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">AED 1,500</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Call us simply at 800 22 to convert your purchase into an Easy Payment Plan.</p>\r\n<p>Terms and conditions apply</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>','','','easy-installment-scheme','','','','','','','','',1,'2017-10-08','08 - October - 2017 01:31:21 PM',1,'12 - May - 2020 03:35:58 PM',4,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(282,0,1,'Emiratization','Emiratization','Emiratization','Emiratization','Emiratization','Emiratization',97,'','','','',1,0,0,'ysp3wn45200hqr9.jpg',1,'<p>Ajman Bank believes in its social responsibility to the community it serves. In order to meet the strategic objective, the bank pays special attention to provide job opportunities to UAE<br />Nationals, motivate them to pursue their higher education, offer fantastic benefits, develop and groom them to take over higher respOnsibilities in their career through training &amp; development and retain the quality talent.</p>\r\n<p>The main emphasis on Emiratization at Ajman Bank stems from the view of the workforce as one of its chief assets, combined with its community banking method. According to its development and growth strategy, investing resources and time into its staff is a fundamental opinion which it views as contributing to the overall good of the organization and the U.A.E.</p>\r\n<p>In line with the nationalization strategy, Ajman bank runs two parallel employment training programmes which reﬂect bank\'s commitment towards providing employment opportunities to fresh graduates as well as experienced nationals and develop competency levels of employees.</p>\r\n<p>The strategy reveals the commitment that Ajman Bank has to reaching out to its community and also supporting the UAE economy in return. As a result of these training programmes, the bank will be able to pinpoint performers who show a strong promising career.</p>\r\n<p><strong>KUNOOZ WATANIYA - \"National Trainee Programme&rdquo;</strong></p>\r\n<p>National Trainee Programme is designed to provide employment opportunities to Fresh UAE Nationals graduates, introduce them to the corpOrate world, train them to be successful in their careers and be a role model for the generations to come.</p>\r\n<p>National Trainees will have to go through a 3 month on the job training plan and upon successful completion will be absorbed in different divisions of the bank.</p>\r\n<p><strong>\"Management Trainee Programme&rdquo; &mdash; An initiative for Experienced Emiratis</strong></p>\r\n<p>Management Trainee programme is designed for UAE Nationals who carries diversified experience within banking industry. The aim is to create a pool of mid-level professionals, provide them on the job rotation through which the candidate is assigned projects and assessed and learn through mentoring and coaching.</p>\r\n<p>Upon campletion of the 6 months training, opportunities will be offered in their area of interests.</p>','','','','emiratization','','','','','','','','',1,'2017-10-23','23 - October - 2017 12:35:16 PM',1,'31 - March - 2020 12:16:46 PM',1,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(283,0,1,'Vacancies','Vacancies','Vacancies','Vacancies','Vacancies','Vacancies',97,'','','','',1,0,0,'z9fgjxcm8nqd635.jpg',1,'<p>Vacancies with Ajman Bank are as follows .</p>','','','','other-vacancies','','','','','','','','',1,'2017-10-23','23 - October - 2017 12:37:47 PM',1,'31 - March - 2020 12:24:24 PM',2,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(284,0,1,'Easy Cash Facility','Easy Cash Facility','Easy Cash Facility','Easy Cash Facility','Easy Cash Facility','Easy Cash Facility',161,'','','','',1,0,0,'5sym473k1rxhc9n.jpg',1,'<p><strong>Get more out of your Credit Card with Ajman Bank Easy Cash facility!</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Avail up to 90% of your available credit card limit as Easy Cash and enjoy a flexible payment plan of up to 12 months.</li>\r\n<li>No paperwork required! Call us at 800 22 to request for Easy Cash.</li>\r\n<li>Flexibility of paying into installments of 3, 6, 9 and 12 months.</li>\r\n<li>Funds transferred to your Ajman Bank account or any other bank account which you may have at other banks in the UAE.</li>\r\n<li>Nominal Processing Fee.</li>\r\n</ul>','<p><strong>Get more out of your Credit Card with Ajman Bank Easy Cash facility!</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Avail up to 90% of your available credit card limit as Easy Cash and enjoy a flexible payment plan of up to 12 months.</li>\r\n<li>No paperwork required! Call us at 800 22 to request for Easy Cash.</li>\r\n<li>Flexibility of paying into installments of 3, 6, 9 and 12 months.</li>\r\n<li>Funds transferred to your Ajman Bank account or any other bank account which you may have at other banks in the UAE.</li>\r\n<li>Nominal Processing Fee.</li>\r\n</ul>','','','easy-cash-facility','','','','','','','','',1,'2017-12-10','10 - December - 2017 10:26:36 AM',NULL,NULL,7,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(285,0,1,'MBTC','MBTC','','','MBTC','MBTC',0,'','','','',0,0,0,NULL,0,'<p>Test</p>','','','','mbtc','','MBTC','','','','','','',1,'2018-01-25','25 - January - 2018 03:44:06 PM',NULL,NULL,35,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(286,0,1,'Balance Transfer Facility ','  ','Balance Transfer Facility ','  ','Balance Transfer Facility ','  ',161,'','','','',1,0,0,'xbg5m2637n4qp9k.jpg',1,'<p>BALANCE TRANSFER Facility</p>\r\n<p><strong>Move to Ajman Bank and save more with Balance Transfer facility!</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Consolidate your credit cards outstanding balance with Ajman Bank&rsquo;s Balance Transfer facility and enjoy greater savings with no profit charges.</li>\r\n<li>No paperwork required! Call us at 800 22 to request for Balance Transfer.</li>\r\n<li>Flexibility of paying into installments of 3, 6, 9 and 12 months.</li>\r\n<li>Nominal Processing Fee</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Terms and conditions apply</p>','<p>BALANCE TRANSFER Facility</p>\r\n<p><strong>Move to Ajman Bank and save more with Balance Transfer facility!</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Consolidate your credit cards outstanding balance with Ajman Bank&rsquo;s Balance Transfer facility and enjoy greater savings with no profit charges.</li>\r\n<li>No paperwork required! Call us at 800 22 to request for Balance Transfer.</li>\r\n<li>Flexibility of paying into installments of 3, 6, 9 and 12 months.</li>\r\n<li>Nominal Processing Fee</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Terms and conditions apply</p>','','','balance-transfer-facility-','','Balance Transfer Facility ','','','','','','',1,'2018-02-14','14 - February - 2018 03:47:10 PM',NULL,NULL,8,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(287,0,1,'Ajman Government-Buy Now Pay Later Program ','   ','Ajman Government-Buy Now Pay Later Program ','','Ajman Government-Buy Now Pay Later Program ','  ',161,'','','','',1,0,0,'0h381zy5fpbn4x7.jpg',1,'<p><strong>Ajman Government &ndash; Buy Now Pay Later Program</strong></p>\r\n<p>Paying Ajman Services and Fees is now simpler by splitting the transactions into Easy Payment Plans done at our participating Ajman Government Entities without any processing charges.</p>\r\n<p>At our preferred partners given below, you can buy now and pay later at flexible payment tenures of 3 &amp; 6 months with a minimum amount of AED 1,000</p>\r\n<table style=\"width: 546px;\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"90\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">S#</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"456\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">Ajman Government Entities</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"90\">\r\n<