February - 2018 04:30:19 PM',1,'16 - January - 2020 05:23:55 PM',9,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(288,0,1,'AGM','AGM','','','AGM','AGM',102,'','','','',1,1,0,'7y9bdrz3nx1pg5w.jpg',1,'<!--<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Invitation of Annual General Meeting of Ajman Bank:-</p>\r\n<div class=\"downloadbtn downloadbtnmulti\"><a id=\"clickdownload\" href=\"../files/AGM_Invitation_-_En.pdf\">AGM Invitation&nbsp;EN<img class=\"img-responsive\" src=\"images/download.png\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>\r\n<div class=\"downloadbtn downloadbtnmulti\"><a id=\"clickdownload\" href=\"../files/AGM_Invitation_-_Ar.pdf\">AGM Invitation&nbsp;AR<img class=\"img-responsive\" src=\"images/download.png\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>-->\r\n<p>Invitation of Annual General Meeting of Ajman Bank:-</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><a title=\"Arabic Invitation\" href=\"../files/AJMANBANK_GA_A_31_03_2020.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Arabic Invitation</a></li>\r\n<li><a title=\"English Invitation\" href=\"../files/AJMANBANK_GA_E_31_03_2020.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">English Invitation</a></li>\r\n<li><a title=\"Financial Statement Y2019 - Arabic\" href=\"../files/Ajman_Bank_Financial_Statements_31_December_2019_Arabic.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Financial Statement Y2019 &ndash;Arabic</a></li>\r\n<li><a title=\"Financial Statement Y2019 - English\" href=\"../files/Ajman_Bank_Financial_Statements_31_December_2019_English.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Financial Statement Y2019 &ndash;English</a></li>\r\n<li><a title=\"AOA Amendment AGM 2020\" href=\"../files/AOA_Amendments_AGM_2020.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Proposed amendments to the Article of Association</a></li>\r\n<li><a title=\"AGM Booklet 2020\" href=\"../files/AGM_Booklet_2020.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">AGM Booklet</a></li>\r\n<li><a title=\"Zakat Calculation\" href=\"../files/ISSC_Zakat_Calculation_and_Shareholders_Notification.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Zakat Calculation</a></li>\r\n<li><a title=\"AGM Resolutions\" href=\"http://www.ajmanbank.ae/site/files/AJMANBANK_GA_RES_20_4_2020.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">AGM Resolutions</a></li>\r\n</ul>','<p>Announcement of the Opening of the Nomination for Membership of the Board of Directors of Ajman Bank:-</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><a href=\"../files/announcement_nomination_Ar_-_EN.PDF\">Announcement of&nbsp;Nomination</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><img src=\"../files/nominations.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"594\" height=\"840\" /></p>','','','agm','','','','','','','','',1,'2018-03-07','07 - March - 2018 01:12:52 PM',1,'11 - June - 2020 01:42:40 PM',5,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(289,0,1,'2 in 1 Account','2 in 1 Account','2 in 1 Account','','2 in 1 Account','2 in 1 Account',155,'','','','',1,0,0,'2fs7jm49yvqr586.jpg',1,'<p><em>ATM/ Debit Card, Cheque book and profit in ONE account!</em></p>\r\n<p>At Ajman Bank we believe that our customers should be able to save and manage their day-to-day transactions at the same time.</p>\r\n<p>Introducing 2 in 1 Account, that provides combined benefits of a Savings and Current Account - an ATM / Debit card, Cheque book facility and flexibility to earn profit on your deposits!&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Features &amp; Benefits </strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>2 in 1 Account can be opened with AED 10,000 or more</li>\r\n<li>Account will be part of Mudaraba pool; a Profit bearing Account with attractive profit rates</li>\r\n<li>Minimum average balance per quarter of AED 10,000 should be maintained to earn profit</li>\r\n<li>*Can be used as a Salary Transfer account or a regular checking account</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Free Cheque book and ATM / Debit card</li>\r\n<li>SMS alerts</li>\r\n<li>Online Banking</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Documents Required </strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Duly filled and signed Account Opening Form and Terms and Conditions (T&amp;Cs)</li>\r\n<li>Original and Copy of Emirates ID for UAE Nationals and Expatriates</li>\r\n<li>Original and Copy of Passport with VISA page for Expatriates</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>*Salary Certificate is required if the account is used as a Salary Transfer account</p>\r\n<p>Terms &amp; Conditions Apply</p>','','','','2-in-1-account','','','','','','','','',1,'2018-03-28','28 - March - 2018 10:36:08 AM',1,'16 - January - 2020 05:04:04 PM',1,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(290,0,1,'    2 in 1 Account','  2 in 1 Account','2 in 1 Account','','  2 in 1 Account','  2 in 1 Account',103,'','','','',1,0,0,'bp9xsjmf56qz37y.jpg',1,'<p align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><em>ATM/ Debit Card, Cheque book and profit in ONE account!</em></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>At Ajman Bank we believe that our customers should be able to save and manage their day-to-day transactions at the same time. </strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Introducing 2 in 1 Account, that provides combined benefits of a Savings and Current Account - an ATM / Debit card, Cheque book facility and flexibility to earn profit on your deposits!&nbsp; </strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Features &amp; Benefits </strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>2 in 1 Account can be opened with AED 10,000 or more</li>\r\n<li>Account will be part of Mudaraba pool; a Profit bearing Account with attractive profit rates</li>\r\n<li>Minimum average balance per quarter of AED 10,000 should be maintained to earn profit</li>\r\n<li>*Can be used as a Salary Transfer account or a regular checking account</li>\r\n<li>Free Cheque book and ATM / Debit card</li>\r\n<li>SMS alerts</li>\r\n<li>Online Banking</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Documents Required </strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Duly filled and signed Account Opening Form and Terms and Conditions (T&amp;Cs)</li>\r\n<li>Original and Copy of Emirates ID for UAE Nationals and Expatriates</li>\r\n<li>Original and Copy of Passport with VISA page for Expatriates</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>*Salary Certificate is required if the account is used as a Salary Transfer account</p>\r\n<p><strong>Terms &amp; Conditions Apply</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>','','','','2-in-1-account-1','','','','','','','','',1,'2018-03-28','28 - March - 2018 11:23:15 AM',1,'28 - March - 2018 03:44:18 PM',12,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(291,0,1,'3D Secure ','3D Secure ','3D Secure ','','3D Secure ','3D Secure ',161,'','','','',1,0,0,'p154m36kdrqtzs7.jpg',1,'<p>Your Card is now extra safe online <br />Introducing 3D Secure on your Ajman Bank Cards</p>\r\n<p>Now your Ajman Bank Debit Card and Credit Card includes added security when you shop online. Our new 3D Secure feature adds an extra layer of verification to all Ajman Bank Cards, so buying online is even more secure.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>How does it work?</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Transact anywhere, anytime. You do not need to install any special software. You can choose any secured website with these&nbsp; &nbsp;logos</li>\r\n<li>It&rsquo;s quick and easy. There is no registration required, since the function is already enabled on your Ajman Bank Card.</li>\r\n<li>Makes your online purchases safer. You will receive a One-Time-Password on your registered mobile every time you transact online.</li>\r\n<li>Simple, Hassle free and convenient.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To learn more about 3D Secure and how it works, please read through the <a href=\"frequently-asked-questions\">Frequently Asked Questions.</a></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Terms &amp; Conditions Apply</p>','<p>Your Card is now extra safe online <br />Introducing 3D Secure on your Ajman Bank Cards</p>\r\n<p>Now your Ajman Bank Debit Card and Credit Card includes added security when you shop online. Our new 3D Secure feature adds an extra layer of verification to all Ajman Bank Cards, so buying online is even more secure.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>How does it work?</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Transact anywhere, anytime. You do not need to install any special software. You can choose any secured website with these&nbsp; &nbsp;logos</li>\r\n<li>It&rsquo;s quick and easy. There is no registration required, since the function is already enabled on your Ajman Bank Card.</li>\r\n<li>Makes your online purchases safer. You will receive a One-Time-Password on your registered mobile every time you transact online.</li>\r\n<li>Simple, Hassle free and convenient.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To learn more about 3D Secure and how it works, please read through the <a href=\"https://www.adcb.com/toolsresources/faqs/3Dsecure/overview.asp\">Frequently Asked Questions.</a></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Terms &amp; Conditions Apply</strong></p>','','','3d-secure-','','','','','','','','',1,'2018-04-04','04 - April - 2018 02:42:46 PM',1,'16 - January - 2020 05:24:34 PM',10,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(292,0,1,'Frequently Asked Questions','Frequently Asked Questions','','','Frequently Asked Questions','Frequently Asked Questions',119,'','','','',1,0,0,'0yghd496jspwf71.jpg',1,'<ul class=\"nomargin-left\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">What is 3D Secure?</span></p>\r\n<ul class=\"nomargin-left\">\r\n<li>3D Secure is a FREE service which is being launched by Ajman Bank that lets you transact online securely using your Credit Card.&nbsp; 3D Secure offers an added layer of verification for extra security when conducting online transactions. You will be required to enter a one-time password (OTP) that will be sent to your registered mobile number, when you make any online transaction on websites that have the &lsquo;VBV &ndash; Verified by VISA&rsquo; or&nbsp; MSC- MasterCard SecureCode sign. This service is available only on 3D Secure merchant sites.</li>\r\n<li>How does 3D Secure protect me against unauthorized online transactions?</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>The 3D Secure feature will require you to enter a one-time password (OTP) which will be sent to your registered mobile number in order to complete your online purchase/transaction.</p>\r\n<ul class=\"nomargin-left\">\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">What is One-time Password (OTP)?</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>A One-time Password is a password that is valid for online transaction, on a computer system or other digital devices. OTP is automatically generated via SMS to your mobile for authentication.</p>\r\n<ul class=\"nomargin-left\">\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">How do I register for 3D Secure?</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>No registration is required. This feature will be automatically enabled on your card. Please ensure that you have updated your latest mobile phone number with us, as the OTP will be sent to the mobile number in our records.</p>\r\n<ul class=\"nomargin-left\">\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">What steps should be followed when conducting an online transaction?</span>\r\n<ul class=\"nomargin-left\">\r\n<li>When you are using your Ajman Bank Credit Card to conduct an online transaction on any 3D Secure website that has the &lsquo;VBV &ndash; Verified by VISA&rsquo; or MSC- MasterCard SecureCode&nbsp; &nbsp;sign, the website will open a new window. It will display Ajman Bank Verified by VISA or&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; MasterCard SecureCode authentication screen.</li>\r\n<li>The transaction details (merchant name, amount, date, last 4 digits of the card number) will be displayed on the authentication screen. Please ensure that the details are accurately filled out.</li>\r\n<li>You will then receive a One Time Password on your registered mobile number. Please enter that OTP on the authentication screen, to initiate the authentication process.</li>\r\n<li>The card details and the authentication results will then be processed and approval is subject to correct card details, the OTP being entered and the card account having an adequate limit for the transaction made.</li>\r\n<li>Once the transaction has been approved, the website will display a payment received acknowledgement.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul class=\"nomargin-left\">\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">How can I update my mobile number?</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>To update your information, please contact your nearest branch</p>\r\n<ul class=\"nomargin-left\">\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">Will I be charged for 3D Secure?</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>No. This service is free.</p>\r\n<ul class=\"nomargin-left\">\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">Is my personal information safe and secure?</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Yes. Your card details are encrypted and stored on a secure server.</p>\r\n<ul class=\"nomargin-left\">\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">I have just received a renewal card, do I have to re-register?</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Not required.</p>\r\n<ul class=\"nomargin-left\">\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">What happened if I entered the 3D Secure One Time Password incorrectly?</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>The transaction will fail after 3 attempts of incorrect password, there after you need to re-initiate the transaction.</p>\r\n<ul class=\"nomargin-left\">\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">How long is the password valid for once I receive it?</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>The password will expire in 10 minutes upon proceeding to the 3D Secure One Time Password page.</p>\r\n<ul class=\"nomargin-left\">\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">How would I know if a merchant is 3D Secure compliant?</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>If a merchant is 3D Secure compliant, you will be able to see the Verified by Visa or&nbsp; MasterCard SecureCode&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;logo on the site.</p>\r\n<ul class=\"nomargin-left\">\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">If I do not have my mobile phone registered with the Bank, can I still make an online purchase? </span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>You will be able to purchase online from merchant websites that do not support 3DS (3D Secure). For 3DS enabled websites, you will not be able to complete a transaction without an OTP. <br /><br /></p>\r\n<ul class=\"nomargin-left\">\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">Can I opt out of the OTP service for online purchases? </span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>An OTP is required for all online purchases made through all 3DS enabled merchants. You may still make online purchases from online merchants that do not support 3DS.</p>\r\n<ul class=\"nomargin-left\">\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">Can the bank resend me the OTP to me due to non-receipt? </span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>No, it may be delayed due to circumstances beyond the Bank&rsquo;s control as it is dependent on your mobile service provider. Please also ensure that your mobile number is updated in the Bank&rsquo;s records in order to receive your OTP from the Bank.</p>\r\n<ul class=\"nomargin-left\">\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">What should I do, if a separate window Verified by Visa or MasterCard SecureCode does not appears in the event of an online payment? </span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>You can do the following: <br />&bull; Check whether the online merchant is a participant of Verified by Visa or MasterCard SecureCode&nbsp; &nbsp;<br />&bull; Check whether your system blocks pop-ups. If necessary, switch off the software that blocks pop-ups.</p>\r\n<ul class=\"nomargin-left\">\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">Can I use Verified by Visa or MasterCard SecureCode on any computer? </span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Yes, you can. You do no need to install any special software. You can always pay online and always rely on extra protection.</p>\r\n<ul class=\"nomargin-left\">\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">To whom will the OTP be sent if my supplementary cardholder is performing an online transaction and supplementary card holder&rsquo;s mobile number is not registered with the Bank? </span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>The OTP will be sent to the primary card holder&rsquo;s registered mobile number.</p>\r\n<ul class=\"nomargin-left\">\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">Can I use one OTP for more than one transaction?</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>No. Every 6 digit OTP is valid only for that particular transaction and cannot be used for any other transaction.</p>\r\n<ul class=\"nomargin-left\">\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">What happens if I do not receive the OTP? </span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>One time password (OTP) would be instantly sent to the mobile phone number in our records, after you have started the transaction and entered your card details. <br />If you do not receive the OTP, please check if your mobile number registered with Ajman Bank is correct or not. If the registered details are correct, you can request for the OTP to be re-sent to you by clicking on the <span style=\"font-size: large;\">resend OTP</span> link.</p>\r\n<p>The resent OTP link will be activated 30 seconds after the first OTP is sent.</p>\r\n<ul class=\"nomargin-left\">\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">How many times can I request for an OTP to be resent to me? </span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>You can request for an OTP to be re-sent to you three times only per transaction. You may need to reinitiate the transactions should you not receive your password after resending for three times.</p>\r\n<ul class=\"nomargin-left\">\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">Can I receive an OTP when I am overseas?</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>We will send the OTP according to your mobile phone number in our record. If you are overseas or using overseas mobile service providers, the service provider may not support international SMS. Please consult your service provider.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>','<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>What is 3D Secure?</strong></li>\r\n<li>3D Secure is a FREE service which is being launched by Ajman Bank that lets you transact online securely using your Credit Card.&nbsp; 3D Secure offers an added layer of verification for extra security when conducting online transactions. You will be required to enter a one-time password (OTP) that will be sent to your registered mobile number, when you make any online transaction on websites that have the &lsquo;VBV &ndash; Verified by VISA&rsquo; or&nbsp; MSC- MasterCard SecureCode sign. This service is available only on 3D Secure merchant sites.</li>\r\n<li><strong>How does 3D Secure protect me against unauthorized online transactions?</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>The 3D Secure feature will require you to enter a one-time password (OTP) which will be sent to your registered mobile number in order to complete your online purchase/transaction.</p>\r\n<p><strong>What is One-time Password (OTP)?</strong></p>\r\n<p>A One-time Password is a password that is valid for online transaction, on a computer system or other digital devices. OTP is automatically generated via SMS to your mobile for authentication.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>How do I register for 3D Secure?</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>No registration is required. This feature will be automatically enabled on your card. Please ensure that you have updated your latest mobile phone number with us, as the OTP will be sent to the mobile number in our records.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>What steps should be followed when conducting an online transaction?</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>When you are using your Ajman Bank Credit Card to conduct an online transaction on any 3D Secure website that has the &lsquo;VBV &ndash; Verified by VISA&rsquo; or MSC- MasterCard SecureCode&nbsp; &nbsp;sign, the website will open a new window. It will display Ajman Bank Verified by VISA or&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; MasterCard SecureCode authentication screen.</li>\r\n<li>The transaction details (merchant name, amount, date, last 4 digits of the card number) will be displayed on the authentication screen. Please ensure that the details are accurately filled out.</li>\r\n<li>You will then receive a One Time Password on your registered mobile number. Please enter that OTP on the authentication screen, to initiate the authentication process.</li>\r\n<li>The card details and the authentication results will then be processed and approval is subject to correct card details, the OTP being entered and the card account having an adequate limit for the transaction made.</li>\r\n<li>Once the transaction has been approved, the website will display a payment received acknowledgement.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>How can I update my mobile number?</strong></p>\r\n<p>To update your information, please contact your nearest branch</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Will I be charged for 3D Secure?</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>No. This service is free.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Is my personal information safe and secure?</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Yes. Your card details are encrypted and stored on a secure server.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>I have just received a renewal card, do I have to re-register?</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Not required.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>What happened if I entered the 3D Secure One Time Password incorrectly?</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>The transaction will fail after 3 attempts of incorrect password, there after you need to re-initiate the transaction.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>How long is the password valid for once I receive it?</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>The password will expire in 10 minutes upon proceeding to the 3D Secure One Time Password page.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>How would I know if a merchant is 3D Secure compliant?</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>If a merchant is 3D Secure compliant, you will be able to see the Verified by Visa or&nbsp; MasterCard SecureCode&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;logo on the site.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>If I do not have my mobile phone registered with the Bank, can I still make an online purchase? </strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>You will be able to purchase online from merchant websites that do not support 3DS (3D Secure). For 3DS enabled websites, you will not be able to complete a transaction without an OTP. <br /><br /></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Can I opt out of the OTP service for online purchases? </strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>An OTP is required for all online purchases made through all 3DS enabled merchants. You may still make online purchases from online merchants that do not support 3DS.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Can the bank resend me the OTP to me due to non-receipt? </strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>No, it may be delayed due to circumstances beyond the Bank&rsquo;s control as it is dependent on your mobile service provider. Please also ensure that your mobile number is updated in the Bank&rsquo;s records in order to receive your OTP from the Bank.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>What should I do, if a separate window Verified by </strong><strong>Visa or MasterCard SecureCode</strong> <strong>does not appears in the event of an online payment? </strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>You can do the following: <br />&bull; Check whether the online merchant is a participant of Verified by Visa or MasterCard SecureCode&nbsp; &nbsp;<br />&bull; Check whether your system blocks pop-ups. If necessary, switch off the software that blocks pop-ups.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Can I use Verified by Visa or MasterCard SecureCode</strong> <strong>on any computer? </strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Yes, you can. You do no need to install any special software. You can always pay online and always rely on extra protection.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>To whom will the OTP be sent if my supplementary cardholder is performing an online transaction and supplementary card holder&rsquo;s mobile number is not registered with the Bank? </strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>The OTP will be sent to the primary card holder&rsquo;s registered mobile number.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Can I use one OTP for more than one transaction?</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>No. Every 6 digit OTP is valid only for that particular transaction and cannot be used for any other transaction.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>What happens if I do not receive the OTP? </strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>One time password (OTP) would be instantly sent to the mobile phone number in our records, after you have started the transaction and entered your card details. <br />If you do not receive the OTP, please check if your mobile number registered with Ajman Bank is correct or not. If the registered details are correct, you can request for the OTP to be re-sent to you by clicking on the <strong>resend OTP </strong>link<strong>. </strong></p>\r\n<p>The resent OTP link will be activated 30 seconds after the first OTP is sent.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>How many times can I request for an OTP to be resent to me? </strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>You can request for an OTP to be re-sent to you three times only per transaction. You may need to reinitiate the transactions should you not receive your password after resending for three times.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Can I receive an OTP when I am overseas?</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>We will send the OTP according to your mobile phone number in our record. If you are overseas or using overseas mobile service providers, the service provider may not support international SMS. Please consult your service provider.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>','','','frequently-asked-questions','','','','','','','','',1,'2018-04-04','04 - April - 2018 02:48:44 PM',1,'11 - June - 2020 10:21:46 AM',36,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(293,0,1,'Upfront Profit Wakala Deposit','Upfront Profit Wakala Deposit','Upfront Profit Wakala Deposit','','Upfront Profit Wakala Deposit','Upfront Profit Wakala Deposit',103,'','','','',1,0,0,'dkwbrn0q2fgpmtc.jpg',1,'<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong><em>See how fast your profits take off </em></strong><em>with Ajman Bank&rsquo;s Upfront Profit Wakala Deposit</em></span></p>\r\n<p>With Ajman Bank&rsquo;s Upfront Profit Wakala Deposit, you&rsquo;ll see your profits take off immediately. Because now, you no longer have to wait for your investments to mature &ndash; you can get your profits upfront and enjoy returns right away.</p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Features &amp; Benefits </strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Receive upfront profit on deposit placement and enjoy returns right away</li>\r\n<li>Withdraw the upfront profit funds as per convenience</li>\r\n<li>Choose from flexible tenure options of 6 months, 1, 2 and 3 years</li>\r\n<li>Minimum deposit amount of AED 100,000</li>\r\n<li>Additional current account with no minimum balance requirement and FREE debit card</li>\r\n<li>Deposits are&nbsp; acceptable only in UAE dirhams</li>\r\n<li>Profit rate calculation based on expected profit rate</li>\r\n<li>Product is structured under Sharia concept of &ldquo;Wakala&rdquo;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Documents Required </strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Duly filled and signed Account Opening Form and Upfront Profit Wakala Deposit Agreement</li>\r\n<li>Original and Copy of Emirates ID for UAE Nationals and Expatriates</li>\r\n<li>Original and Copy of Passport for both UAE Nationals and Expatriates (VISA page is required for Expatriates)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Terms &amp; Conditions Apply</strong></p>','','','','upfront-profit-wakala','','','','','','','','',1,'2018-05-27','27 - May - 2018 11:51:22 AM',1,'29 - May - 2018 12:55:03 PM',13,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(294,0,1,'PayPerKay Offer','PayPerKay Offer','','','PayPerKay Offer','PayPerKay Offer',273,'','','','',1,0,0,'dtpvxr3fj1g2khn.jpg',1,'<p><strong>Benefits for Ajman Bank Credit Card customers</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>All Ajman Bank PayPerKay customers will be automatically upgraded from the Infiniti Q30 to The Q50 simply by using Ajman Bank Credit Card for the lease payments (Infiniti Q50 offer is limited to 12 months, however the other vehicles can be leased for longer period)</li>\r\n<li>Added to this there is also an exclusive offer of 500 kms extra per month</li>\r\n<li>Private individual vehicle-Leasing packages ranging from 12 to 36 months</li>\r\n<li>For more information call PayPerKay 800-PPKAY (800-77529) or click here <a href=\"http://www.payperkay.ae/how-does-payperkay-work/\">http://www.payperkay.ae/how-does-payperkay-work/</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>*Terms and conditions apply</p>','','','','ramadan-offer','','','','','','','','',1,'2018-06-05','05 - June - 2018 01:56:26 PM',1,'05 - July - 2018 09:42:53 AM',3,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(295,0,1,'MasterCard  spend and win','MasterCard  spend and win','MasterCard  spend and win','MasterCard  spend and win','MasterCard  spend and win','MasterCard  spend and win',273,'','','','',1,0,0,NULL,0,'<p>Start exploring more to get back more</p>\r\n<p>Use your Ajman Bank MasterCard Debit or Credit Card when you travel abroad for a chance to win $2,500</p>\r\n<p>Campaign Details:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Valid from 15<sup>th</sup> July to 15<sup>th</sup> September 2018</li>\r\n<li>International Point of Sale (POS) purchases or cash withdrawals made abroad will be eligible</li>\r\n<li>Final list of winners will be announced after the campaign period</li>\r\n<li>US $ 2,500 per winner will be credited to customers account after the campaign period</li>\r\n<li>Minimum 3 transactions should be done abroad for a minimum amount of US $ 15 ( or local currency equivalent) to qualify for the campaign</li>\r\n<li>For more details, refer <a href=\"../files/TCs_Cross_border_campaign_english_final_UAE_050718.docx\">terms and conditions </a></li>\r\n</ul>','','','','mastercard-spend-and-win','','','','','','','','',1,'2018-07-24','24 - July - 2018 10:35:24 AM',1,'07 - October - 2018 09:29:54 AM',14,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(296,0,1,'Samsung Pay ','Samsung Pay  ','Samsung Pay ','Samsung Pay ','Samsung Pay ','Samsung Pay ',171,'','','','',1,0,0,'byj1g37pmd06vz5.jpg',1,'<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;<img style=\"width: 100% !important;\" src=\"../files/web_samsung_steps-01.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"577\" height=\"123\" /></p>\r\n<p><img style=\"width: 100% !important;\" src=\"../files/web_contentsamsunge.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1019\" height=\"4991\" /></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"../files/tc.pdf\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Terms and conditions link</span></a></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"../files/FAQ-Samsung_pay_General_final.pdf\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Frequently asked questions link</span></a></p>','','','','samsung-pay-mastercard','','','','','','','','',1,'2018-07-26','26 - July - 2018 02:49:35 PM',1,'16 - January - 2020 07:39:33 PM',7,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(297,0,1,'Contactless','Contactless','','','Contactless','Contactless',171,'','','','',1,0,0,'s975tgv324hx1jr.jpg',1,'<p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><strong>Turn speed into smiles with Ajman Bank Contactless: </strong></span></p>\r\n<p><br /><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Your transactions are now faster with Ajman Banks contactless technology.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Contactless transactions are payment transactions that does not require a physical contact between your card and the merchant\'s terminal, thus allowing you to make payments faster and easier as well as reducing the need for you to carry cash!</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Terms &amp; Conditions Apply</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a href=\"../files/FAQs.pdf\">FAQ\'s</a></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>','<p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><strong>Turn speed into smiles with Ajman Bank Contactless: </strong></span></p>\r\n<p><br /><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Your transactions are now faster with Ajman Banks contactless technology.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Contactless transactions are payment transactions that does not require a physical contact between your card and the merchant\'s terminal, thus allowing you to make payments faster and easier as well as reducing the need for you to carry cash!</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Terms &amp; Conditions Apply</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a href=\"../files/FAQs.pdf\">FAQ\'s</a></span></p>','','','contactless','','','','','','','','',1,'2018-09-09','09 - September - 2018 02:16:57 PM',1,'04 - November - 2018 10:31:52 AM',8,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(298,0,1,'  #YOUNG account','  #YOUNG account','#YOUNG account','#YOUNG  account','#YOUNG account','#YOUNG account',155,'','','','',1,0,0,'pk1tfn5gxmz6hvq.jpg',1,'<p style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong>Ajman Bank #YOUNG&nbsp;account is an ideal choice to help your child take the first step towards financial discipline. It is a fully sharia&rsquo;h compliant savings account that encourage your kids to save, earn profits and see their money grow with time.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><strong>Features and Benefits</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Exclusive Savings account, with no fall below charges</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Can be opened only for Minors (below 18 years old)</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Specially designed debit card in the name of the &ldquo;Minor&rdquo;</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Denominated&nbsp;in AED currency only</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">No minimum account balance required</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">A minimum initial deposit of only AED 500 required to open the account</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Profit bearing account based on the concept of &ldquo;Mudaraba&rdquo;</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Minimum balance required to earn profits is AED 5,000</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">24/7 toll-free number (80022)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><strong>Documents Required</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Dully filled and signed account opening application form</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Original Passport and Emirates ID for UAE nationals and expatriates *</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Original Visa page for expatriates *</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">* The identification documents to be provided for both Guardian and Minor.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><em>Note: The bank will maintain the right to ask for additional document(s), if required.</em></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">For more details, please visit our nearest branch or call our toll free number 80022.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;</span></p>','<p align=\"center\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong>Ajman Bank #YOUNG&nbsp;account is an ideal choice to help your child take the first step towards financial discipline. It is a fully sharia&rsquo;h compliant savings account that encourage your kids to save, earn profits and see their money grow with time.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Features and Benefits</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exclusive Savings account, with no fall below charges</li>\r\n<li>Can be opened only for Minors (below 18 years old)</li>\r\n<li>Specially designed debit card in the name of the &ldquo;Minor&rdquo;</li>\r\n<li>Denominated&nbsp;in AED currency only</li>\r\n<li>No minimum account balance required</li>\r\n<li>A minimum initial deposit of only AED 500 required to open the account</li>\r\n<li>Profit bearing account based on the concept of &ldquo;Mudaraba&rdquo;</li>\r\n<li>Minimum balance required to earn profits is AED 5,000</li>\r\n<li>24/7 toll-free number (80022)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Documents Required</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Dully filled and signed account opening application form</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Original Passport and Emirates ID for UAE nationals and expatriates *</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Original Visa page for expatriates *</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>* The identification documents to be provided for both Guardian and Minor.</p>\r\n<p><em>Note: The bank will maintain the right to ask for additional document(s), if required.</em></p>\r\n<p>For more details, please visit our nearest branch or call our toll free number 80022.</p>\r\n<p><strong><a href=\"../files/_YNG_Account_-_TCs.pdf\">Terms and Conditions apply</a>.</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>','','','yng-account','','','','','','','','',1,'2019-02-24','24 - February - 2019 08:37:28 AM',1,'11 - June - 2020 12:47:06 PM',4,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(299,0,22,'#YOUNG account','#YOUNG account','','','#YOUNG account','#YOUNG account',103,'http://www.ajmanbank.ae/site/yng-account.html','http://www.ajmanbank.ae/site/yng-account.html','','',1,1,0,'03m9wsy4b7j162g.jpg',1,'','','','','yng-account-1','','','','','','','','',1,'2019-02-24','24 - February - 2019 08:41:07 AM',1,'12 - May - 2020 01:23:52 PM',14,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(300,0,22,'#YNG account','#YNG account','','','#YNG account','#YNG account',155,'http://www.ajmanbank.ae/site/yng-account.html','http://www.ajmanbank.ae/site/yng-account.html','','',1,1,0,NULL,0,'','','','','yng-account-2','','','','','','','','',1,'2019-02-24','24 - February - 2019 08:43:12 AM',1,'18 - March - 2019 09:36:43 AM',3,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(301,0,1,'BRight Card','BRight Card','BRight Card','BRight Card','BRight Card','BRight Card',161,'','','','',1,0,0,'mwqy7t81n4cds3r.jpg',1,'<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Enjoy an ultimate rewards experience with the BRight Credit Card -The Right Choice for exclusive travel benefits. The BRight Credit Card is based on the on the sharia concept of Murabaha.</p>\r\n<p>With Ajman Bank BRight Credit Card, you can immediately start planning for your next travel journey using your Complimentary BRight Rewards. With travel options across 300+ airlines and 300,000 hotels and 0% Foreign Transaction Fees, this card is designed to be your best travel companion.</p>\r\n<p>You can earn BRight rewards on all your retail purchases with the BRight Credit Card. The more you use your BRight Credit Card, the more you maximize your chances to redeem BRight reward conveniently at <a href=\"http://www.ajmanrewards.ae/\">www.ajmanrewards.ae</a></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>','','','','bright-card','','','','','','','','',1,'2019-03-06','06 - March - 2019 10:27:00 AM',1,'06 - March - 2019 04:00:08 PM',0,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(302,0,1,'BRight World','BRight World','BRight World','BRight World','BRight World','BRight World',301,'','','','',1,0,0,'9hb6nv37gt2xysf.jpg',1,'<p><strong>KEY PRODUCT <strong>FEATURES</strong>:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>FLY for FREE</strong> with Upfront 15,000 Complimentary <strong>BRight</strong> Rewards</li>\r\n<li><strong>0% Foreign Transaction Fees</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Complimentary Lounge Access</strong></li>\r\n<li>Earn up to <strong>3 BRight Rewards</strong>&nbsp;for every AED 10 spend</li>\r\n<li>Valet Parking&nbsp;4 times a month at over 35 locations\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>CARD FEATURES:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Samsung Pay</strong>: Enjoy seamless &amp; secure payment experience through mobile using Samsung Pay</li>\r\n<li><strong>Mobile Banking</strong>: Manage your credit card conveniently with our multi-functional Mobile Banking</li>\r\n<li><strong>Contactless: </strong>Enjoy faster &amp; convenient transactions for smaller day to day shopping</li>\r\n<li><strong>Secured Online Purchases: </strong>Shop online with peace of mindwithour3D Secure feature</li>\r\n<li><strong>CHIP &amp; PIN:</strong> Ensures maximum security through your personalized PIN</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>PROGRAMS:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>BRight Rewards Program</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Faster Rewards Accumulation:</strong> Earn <strong>3 BRight Rewards</strong> for every AED 10 spend</li>\r\n<li><strong>Unlimited Redemption Options:</strong> Redeem <strong>