e-ajman-bank-company-account','','','','','','','','',1,'2019-10-17','17 - October - 2019 09:33:10 AM',1,'12 - May - 2020 02:49:37 PM',9,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(309,0,1,'The Ajman Bank Company Account','The Ajman Bank Company Account','The Ajman Bank Company Account','The Ajman Bank Company Account','The Ajman Bank Company Account','The Ajman Bank Company Account',103,'','','','',0,1,0,'bvs15fnzp6qhmjc.jpg',1,'<p>To help your business grow we support you with a wide range of sharia compliant products and services:</p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>Features and Benefits</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Free cheque books*</li>\r\n<li>Free Platinum MasterCard debit card for sole proprietorships and single signatory accounts</li>\r\n<li>Free access to Online and Mobile banking application</li>\r\n<li>Free local and international transfers through mobile banking</li>\r\n<li>WPS payroll processing facility at competitive rates</li>\r\n<li>Dedicated relationship manager for all your banking needs</li>\r\n<li>Staff Medical Insurance in easy monthly installments</li>\r\n<li>AED checking account (2 in 1 account) with profits based on the concept of &ldquo;Mudaraba&rdquo;</li>\r\n<li>Minimum balance to earn profits is AED 10,000 per quarter</li>\r\n<li>24/7 access to contact center through our toll free number</li>\r\n<li>24/7 access to cash deposits and withdrawals through CCDMs and ATMs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For more details, please visit our nearest branch or call 80022.</p>\r\n<p>*Terms and Conditions apply</p>','<p>To help your business grow we support you with a wide range of sharia compliant products and services:</p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>Features and Benefits</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Free cheque books*</li>\r\n<li>Free Platinum MasterCard debit card for sole proprietorships and single signatory accounts</li>\r\n<li>Free access to Online and Mobile banking application</li>\r\n<li>Free local and international transfers through mobile banking</li>\r\n<li>WPS payroll processing facility at competitive rates</li>\r\n<li>Dedicated relationship manager for all your banking needs</li>\r\n<li>Staff Medical Insurance in easy monthly installments</li>\r\n<li>AED checking account (2 in 1 account) with profits based on the concept of &ldquo;Mudaraba&rdquo;</li>\r\n<li>Minimum balance to earn profits is AED 10,000 per quarter</li>\r\n<li>24/7 access to contact center through our toll free number</li>\r\n<li>24/7 access to cash deposits and withdrawals through CCDMs and ATMs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For more details, please visit our nearest branch or call 80022.</p>\r\n<p>*Terms and Conditions apply</p>','','','the-ajman-bank-company-account-1','','','','','','','','',1,'2019-10-17','17 - October - 2019 09:39:09 AM',1,'21 - November - 2019 12:25:43 PM',9,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(310,0,1,'Security Tips','Security Tips','Security Tips','Security Tips','Security Tips','Security Tips',98,'','','','',1,0,0,'q87xpkn3swyrfh9.jpg',1,'<h1><strong>Online Banking Security Tips</strong></h1>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Use Alpha Numeric passwords upper and lower case letters i.e. Laptop682</li>\r\n<li>Do not use share your password with any person</li>\r\n<li>Change your password frequently</li>\r\n<li>Disable <strong>Remember Password</strong> options in the Internet Browser while accessing Internet Banking systems.</li>\r\n<li>Avoid logging into Internet Banking from public sites</li>\r\n<li>Do not respond to emails asking for Online Banking usernames and passwords</li>\r\n<li>Install and regularly update your anti-virus software on your computer</li>\r\n<li>Logout of your internet banking session as soon as you finish. Do not leave your internet banking session Open and unattended</li>\r\n<li>Periodically review your beneficiaries listed in your online baking</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h1><strong>Credit Card Security Tips</strong></h1>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Do not keep your PIN with Your Card together</li>\r\n<li>Use an ATM alone and shield the keypad with your hand when entering your PIN</li>\r\n<li>Change your PIN periodically</li>\r\n<li>Do not disclose your PIN(Personal Identification Number ) to anyone</li>\r\n<li>Never write your PIN or Password on your ATM card or Credit card. Memorize your PIN or Password</li>\r\n<li>Report jammed, retained and lost/stolen Card immediately</li>\r\n<li>Don&rsquo;t send emails that quote your card number, expiry date, and Card verification code Value</li>\r\n<li>Destroy old cards by cutting through the magnetic strip and chip</li>\r\n<li>Review your Card statement to report suspicious transaction Timely</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h1><strong>Avoid Phishing Scams</strong></h1>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Don&rsquo;t reply to any e-mail or SMS that requests your personal information, Card and Pin, Username and password information</li>\r\n<li>Don&rsquo;t trust the display name in the email. Do not only just check the name of the person sending you the email. Check their email address by hovering your mouse over the &lsquo;from&rsquo; address. Make sure no alterations (like additional numbers or letters) have been made</li>\r\n<li>Beware of the tone of the text. Attackers will use a tone that creates ofsense of urgency to entice users (e.g: Verify your account immediately, Your ATM card was Blocked, etc..).</li>\r\n<li>Don&rsquo;t directly open any links in the body of the email or SMS. Hover over the link, If the link in the text isn\'t identical to the URL displayed as the cursor, that\'s a sure sign you will be taken to a site you don&rsquo;t want to visit</li>\r\n<li>Don&rsquo;t open any email attachments you weren&rsquo;t expecting. Malicious attachment contain viruses and malware is a common phishing tactic. Malware can damage files on your computer, steal your passwords or spy on you without your knowledge</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h1><strong>Cheques security Tips</strong></h1>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Do not leave your cheque book unattended. Always keep your cheque book in a safe place.</li>\r\n<li>Whenever you receive your cheque book, please count the number of cheque leaves in it. If there is a discrepancy, bring it to the notice of the Bank immediately</li>\r\n<li>Record all details of cheques issued.</li>\r\n<li>If you close your account, shred any unused cheques</li>\r\n<li>Do not sign blank cheques or cheques written by others. Always fill in the date, the name of the receiver and the amount yourself before signing the cheque</li>\r\n<li>Always use your own pen to protect yourself from &ldquo;Magic ink Pen&rdquo; Scam where the ink disappears after sometime</li>\r\n<li>Don&rsquo;t issue cheques to unknown people, sometimes fraudsters offer deals which are &ldquo;too good to be true&rdquo; to get a cheque sample from victims</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>','','','','security-tips','','','','','','','','',1,'2019-11-19','19 - November - 2019 03:41:33 PM',1,'04 - May - 2020 12:04:26 PM',13,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(311,0,27,'BRight Credit Card','BRight Credit Card','BRight Credit Card','BRight Credit Card','BRight Credit Card','BRight Credit Card',0,'','','','',0,0,0,'2rqnjc0m73kbwst.jpg',1,'<p>Enjoy an ultimate rewards experience with BRight Credit Card - The Right Choice for exclusive travel benefits.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We have designed some exceptional travel benefits and packed in this card for you:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Start planning your next travel journey using Complimentary BRight Rewards</li>\r\n<li>0% Foreign Transaction Fees on your international purchases</li>\r\n<li>Complimentary Lounge Access to over 900+ airport lounges worldwide</li>\r\n<li>Free for life card options</li>\r\n<li>Faster Rewards accumulation - Earn up to 3 BRight Rewards&nbsp;for every AED 10 spend</li>\r\n<li>Unlimited Redemption options: Travel options across 300+ airlines and 300,000 hotels along with electronic purchases and gift vouchers for loved ones</li>\r\n</ul>','','','','bright-credit-card','','','','','','','','',1,'2020-01-26','26 - January - 2020 10:07:28 AM',1,'26 - January - 2020 04:38:32 PM',36,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(317,0,22,'Home','Home','','','Home','Home',0,'http://192.168.1.173/ajmanbank_newdesign/index.php','index.php','','',1,0,0,'h2j6gbw4x7skt5d.jpg',1,'','','','','home','','','','','','','','',1,'2020-03-17','17 - March - 2020 05:32:46 PM',1,'14 - June - 2020 12:28:25 PM',1,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(318,0,3,'Forms','Forms','Forms','Forms','Forms','Forms',0,'','','','',1,0,0,'hj0vzywrc9f58d1.jpg',1,'<div class=\"row page-content\"><input id=\"TotalBoxCount\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"8\" />\r\n<div class=\" row inner-row-line extrapage\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-lg-4 contentboxall\">\r\n<div class=\"box-all-container box-all-container1\" style=\"opacity: 1;\">\r\n<div class=\"box-icon-container\"><img class=\"img-responsive\" src=\"files/web_banners/thumb_d4tsbc3yk1nv27j.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\r\n<div class=\"box-text-container box-text-container-border-left box-text-container-border-right\"><span>Account Application Form - Singly</span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"text-all-container text-all-container1\" style=\"opacity: 1;\">\r\n<div class=\"text-container-main text-container-main-footer\">\r\n<div class=\"downloadbtn downloadbtnpage\"><a href=\"files/Individual Account Opening Form - Single Applicant.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Download<img class=\"img-responsive\" src=\"images/download.png\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"clearfix\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-lg-4 contentboxall\">\r\n<div class=\"box-all-container box-all-container2\" style=\"opacity: 1;\">\r\n<div class=\"box-icon-container\"><img class=\"img-responsive\" src=\"files/web_banners/thumb_zyhx6t7bg1d5pvm.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\r\n<div class=\"box-text-container box-text-container-border-right box-text-container-border-left\"><span>Account Application Form - Jointly</span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div