li>\r\n<li>Dragon Mart 1</li>\r\n<li>Dragon Mart 2</li>\r\n<li>Outlet Village</li>\r\n<li>The Pointe</li>\r\n<li>Bluewaters</li>\r\n<li>The Beach, Box Park</li>\r\n<li>IMG World of Adventure</li>\r\n<li>La Mer</li>\r\n<li>Dubai Airport Free Zone Authority</li>\r\n<li>Dubai Courts</li>\r\n<li>Dubai Design District (1<sup>st</sup> 3 hours only)</li>\r\n<li>Dubai International Airports T1, T2 &amp; T3 (1<sup>st</sup> hour only)</li>\r\n<li>Al Maktoum International Airport (1<sup>st</sup> hour only)</li>\r\n<li>Business Village (1<sup>st</sup> hour only)</li>\r\n<li>Al Garhoud Private Hospital</li>\r\n<li>American Hospital</li>\r\n<li>Last Exit &ndash; Al Khawaneej&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Sharjah: </strong>City Centre Sharjah</p>\r\n<p><strong>Fujairah: </strong>City Centre Fujairah</p>\r\n<p><strong>Abu Dhabi:&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Yas Mall</li>\r\n<li>Dalma Mall</li>\r\n<li>Marina Mall</li>\r\n<li>Ferrari World</li>\r\n<li>Khalidiyah Mall</li>\r\n<li>Mushrif Mall Abu Dhabi</li>\r\n<li>Yas Waterworld</li>\r\n<li>Warner Bros. World</li>\r\n<li>Madar City&nbsp; (1st 3 hours only)</li>\r\n<li>Cleveland Clinic Abu Dhabi</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Eligible Ajman Bank Cards &amp; Usage:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Enjoy this offer on the following Ajman Bank Credit Cards on a minimum spend of AED 3,000 per month:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>&nbsp; BRight Mastercard World Card: 4 times a month</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp; BRight Mastercard Platinum Card: 3 times a month</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp; BRight Mastercard Titanium Card: 2 times a month</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp; Priority Mastercard Debit Card: 2 times a month (no minimum spend requirement)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Terms and Conditions and Frequently Asked Questions are given <a href=\"../files/Valet_Parking_TC.pdf\"><strong>here</strong></a>&nbsp;.</p>\r\n<p>SMS BRight to 6466 or call 800 22 to apply for the BRight credit card NOW!</p>','','','','valet-parking-service-1','','','','','','','','',1,'2020-06-11','11 - June - 2020 12:56:50 PM',1,'14 - June - 2020 12:16:20 PM',11,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(329,0,1,'MORE Rewards','MORE Rewards','MORE Rewards','MORE Rewards','MORE Rewards','MORE Rewards',99,'','','','',1,0,0,'xbt08n2kzpyj5vm.jpg',1,'<p><a title=\"More Rewards\" href=\"../site/More-rewards\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>MORE Rewards</strong></a><strong><a href=\"../More-rewards\" target=\"_blank\">&nbsp;</a>from Ajman Bank &ndash; a program that rewards you for all the ways you bank with us.</strong></p>\r\n<p>This program has been designed to reward you for every time you interact with the bank, use our services and avail our solutions. You are already used to earning rewards whenever you use your credit card but now you will be earning MORE Rewards even when you use your debit card, register for our digital banking, deposit cash through CCDMs or even when you open a new account.</p>\r\n<p>Redeem <strong>MORE Rewards</strong> for a wide variety of consumer electronics and much more through our digital portal seamlessly and have them delivered directly to your doorstep. You can also choose &lsquo;GIFT Vouchers&rsquo;&nbsp; for your family and loved ones for special occasions in addition to a redemption option for 300+ airlines for ticket booking, 300,000+ hotel stay options, at <a title=\"More Rewards\" href=\"../site/More-rewards\" target=\"_blank\">www.ajmanbank.ae/site/MORE-Rewards&nbsp;</a></p>\r\n<p><strong>Products, Interactions &amp; Activities included in MORE Rewards:</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Credit Card Spends:</strong></p>\r\n<p>BRight Card: Up to 3 Rewards for AED 10 spend</p>\r\n<p>Power Card: 1 Reward for AED 10 spend</p>\r\n<p><strong>Debit Card Spends:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Local Spends: 1 Reward for AED 100 spend</p>\r\n<p>International Spends: 1.5 Reward for AED 100 spend</p>\r\n<p>Applicable on Platinum &amp; World Debit Cards</p>\r\n<p><strong>Digital Banking:</strong></p>\r\n<p>100 Rewards for 1<sup>st</sup> time activation of Online or Mobile Banking</p>\r\n<p><strong>CCDM Deposits:</strong></p>\r\n<p>1 Reward for minimum deposit of AED 300</p>\r\n<p><strong>Account Opening:</strong></p>\r\n<p>100 Rewards for opening a current or savings account.</p>\r\n<p>Standard Savings, Current, 2-in-1 and #YOUNG account included.</p>\r\n<p><a title=\"More Rewards Terms &amp; Conditions\" href=\"https://www.ajmanbank.ae/site/files/More_Rewards_Terms_Conditions_Updated.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Terms and Conditions Apply</a></p>','','','','more-rewards','','','','','','','','',1,'2020-06-16','16 - June - 2020 09:34:20 AM',NULL,NULL,4,0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(330,332,NULL,'test','Home',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'','',1,0,0,NULL,1,'we','qweqwe','ef','qwerqweq','test-2','Home','test','','','','','','',1,NULL,'2020-08-04 11:21:17',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,'2020-08-04 11:21:17'),(331,330,NULL,'test','Home',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'','',1,1,0,NULL,1,'we','qweqwe','ef','qwerqweq','test','Home','test','','','','','','',1,NULL,'2020-08-04 11:19:46',1,'2020-08-04 11:23:31',NULL,2,1,'2020-08-04 11:23:31'),(332,331,NULL,'test','Home',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'','',1,1,0,NULL,1,'we','qweqwe','ef','qwerqweq','test-1','Home','test','','','','','','',1,NULL,'2020-08-04 11:19:52',1,'2020-08-04 11:23:53',NULL,2,1,'2020-08-04 11:23:53'),(333,332,NULL,'test','Home',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'','',1,0,0,NULL,1,'we','qweqwe','ef','qwerqweq','test-6','Home','test','','','','','','',1,NULL,'2020-08-04 11:21:17',1,'2020-08-04 11:24:13',NULL,2,1,'2020-08-04 11:24:13'),(334,333,NULL,'test','asdf','','','Home','Home',0,'','','','',0,0,0,NULL,1,'erwert','sdfgsd','asdf','sdfasf','test-2','asdf','test','','','','','','',1,NULL,'2020-08-04 12:55:53',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,'2020-08-04 12:55:53'),(335,333,NULL,'test','asdf','','','Home','Home',0,'','','','',0,0,0,NULL,1,'erwert','sdfgsd','asdf','sdfasf','test-2','asdf','test',''