trong> for a wide variety of consumer electronics and much more through our digital portal seamlessly and have them delivered directly to your doorstep. You can also choose &lsquo;GIFT Vouchers&rsquo;&nbsp; for your family and loved ones for special occasions in addition to a redemption option for 300+ airlines for ticket booking, 300,000+ hotel stay options, at <a title=\"More Rewards\" href=\"../site/More-rewards\" target=\"_blank\">www.ajmanbank.ae/site/MORE-Rewards&nbsp;</a></p>\r\n<p><strong>Products, Interactions &amp; Activities included in MORE Rewards:</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Credit Card Spends:</strong></p>\r\n<p>BRight Card: Up to 3 Rewards for AED 10 spend</p>\r\n<p>Power Card: 1 Reward for AED 10 spend</p>\r\n<p><strong>Debit Card Spends:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Local Spends: 1 Reward for AED 100 spend</p>\r\n<p>International Spends: 1.5 Reward for AED 100 spend</p>\r\n<p>Applicable on Platinum &amp; World Debit Cards</p>\r\n<p><strong>Digital Banking:</strong></p>\r\n<p>100 Rewards for 1<sup>st</sup> time activation of Online or Mobile Banking</p>\r\n<p><strong>CCDM Deposits:</strong></p>\r\n<p>1 Reward for minimum deposit of AED 300</p>\r\n<p><strong>Account Opening:</strong></p>\r\n<p>100 Rewards for opening a current or savings account.</p>\r\n<p>Standard Savings, Current, 2-in-1 and #YOUNG account included.</p>\r\n<p><a title=\"More Rewards Terms &amp; Conditions\" href=\"https://www.ajmanbank.ae/site/files/More_Rewards_Terms_Conditions_Updated.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Terms and Conditions Apply</a></p>','','','','more-rewards','','','','','','','','',1,'2020-06-16','16 - June - 2020 09:34:20 AM',NULL,NULL,4,3,1,'2020-08-09 08:55:15'),(380,344,9,'Register','Register','','','Register','Register',0,'','','','',1,0,0,NULL,1,'','','','','register','Register','Register','','','','','','',1,NULL,'2020-08-09 09:26:54',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,'2020-08-09 09:26:54'),(381,344,9,'Register','التسجيل','','','Register','التسجيل',0,'','','','',1,0,0,NULL,1,'','','','','r